<ns0:body>
<ns0:div>
<ns0:p xml:id="p1" begin="553050000t" end="573910000t" region="bottomCenter">BEK LAMA: Sedikit yang<ns0:br />tahu keseluruhan cerita.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p2" begin="573910000t" end="610610000t" region="bottomCenter">ia berlaku seperti ini...<ns0:br />Dari apa yang saya ingat,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p3" begin="618120000t" end="641050000t" region="bottomCenter">Sebelum sejarah<ns0:br />bermula,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p4" begin="641050000t" end="667340000t" region="bottomCenter">Mesir adalah tempat<ns0:br />kelahiran semua kehidupan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p5" begin="667340000t" end="701950000t" region="bottomCenter">Syurga yang layak bagi<ns0:br />tuhan yang menciptanya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p6" begin="701950000t" end="727400000t" region="bottomCenter">memutuskan untuk tinggal<ns0:br />di sana Jadi tuhan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p7" begin="727400000t" end="741150000t" region="bottomCenter">bersama ciptaan mereka<ns0:br />yang lebih kecil,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p8" begin="747000000t" end="760760000t" region="bottomCenter">lelaki.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p9" begin="766180000t" end="784950000t" region="bottomCenter">tidak silap<ns0:br />tuhan Tetapi ada</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p10" begin="784950000t" end="806220000t" region="bottomCenter">di antara manusia<ns0:br />yang menyembah mereka.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p11" begin="806220000t" end="828330000t" region="bottomCenter">Dewa-dewa itu<ns0:br />lebih tinggi</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p12" begin="828330000t" end="843340000t" region="bottomCenter">urat mereka bukannya darah.<ns0:br />dengan emas mengalir melalui</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p13" begin="862110000t" end="881290000t" region="bottomCenter">berubah sesuka hati<ns0:br />Dan mereka boleh</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p14" begin="881290000t" end="904240000t" region="bottomCenter">daripada binatang yang<ns0:br />menakutkan. ke dalam semua cara</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p15" begin="935940000t" end="973470000t" region="bottomCenter">antara dua saudara yang<ns0:br />kuat. Mesir sendiri berpecah</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p16" begin="973470000t" end="1006420000t" region="bottomCenter">Osiris, Tuhan Kehidupan,<ns0:br />adalah raja yang dikasihi</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p17" begin="1006420000t" end="1031020000t" region="bottomCenter">dilimpahi oleh Sungai<ns0:br />Nil. daripada semua tanah</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p18" begin="1048130000t" end="1086500000t" region="bottomCenter">memerintah padang pasir yang<ns0:br />tandus, saudaranya, Set,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p19" begin="1086500000t" end="1131540000t" region="bottomCenter">kepahitan dalam pengasingannya.<ns0:br />mencari kedua-dua kekuatan dan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p20" begin="1131540000t" end="1167420000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi kemudian tiba masanya<ns0:br />untuk Osiris menobatkan raja baru.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p21" begin="1167420000t" end="1195780000t" region="bottomCenter">Anak lelaki<ns0:br />tunggalnya, Horus.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p22" begin="1195780000t" end="1220390000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia adalah keputusan yang akan<ns0:br />menguji ikatan saudara-saudara</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p23" begin="1220390000t" end="1238740000t" region="bottomCenter">dan nasib<ns0:br />seluruh Mesir.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p24" begin="1441850000t" end="1461870000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi tuhan hanya<ns0:br />separuh kisah kita.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p25" begin="1468550000t" end="1488990000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia telah<ns0:br />menjadi jelas</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p26" begin="1488990000t" end="1511100000t" region="bottomCenter">perjalanan takdir sahaja. bahawa<ns0:br />mereka tidak dapat membentuk</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p27" begin="1511100000t" end="1532780000t" region="bottomCenter">Seorang lelaki yang mempunyai<ns0:br />pertimbangan yang luar biasa,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p28" begin="1532780000t" end="1561970000t" region="bottomCenter">kebijaksanaan dan<ns0:br />ketabahan akan diperlukan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p29" begin="1561970000t" end="1607020000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya bukan lelaki<ns0:br />seperti itu. Malangnya,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p30" begin="1607020000t" end="1634970000t" region="bottomCenter">diri saya yang lebih muda bodoh,<ns0:br />Tetapi sebelum anda menolak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p31" begin="1634970000t" end="1649570000t" region="bottomCenter">ingat...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p32" begin="1656660000t" end="1677090000t" region="bottomCenter">Jangan pernah<ns0:br />meragui lelaki</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p33" begin="1677090000t" end="1702110000t" region="bottomCenter">berjuang untuk satu perkara yang<ns0:br />berkuasa seperti mana-mana tuhan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p34" begin="1702110000t" end="1712120000t" region="bottomCenter">LELAKI: Tiga<ns0:br />ratus, mustahil.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p35" begin="1712120000t" end="1722550000t" region="bottomCenter">BEK TUA:<ns0:br />Sayang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p36" begin="1728400000t" end="1741730000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia adalah harga<ns0:br />yang terbaik.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p37" begin="1760100000t" end="1775110000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus) Pencuri!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p38" begin="1775110000t" end="1792200000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p39" begin="1792200000t" end="1804300000t" region="bottomCenter">LELAKI: Berhenti!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p40" begin="1832240000t" end="1856440000t" region="bottomCenter">Pakaian ini tiada<ns0:br />harapan. ZAYA: (MENGESEH)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p41" begin="1856440000t" end="1873950000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya perlu membeli beberapa<ns0:br />reben untuk memulakan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p42" begin="1873950000t" end="1893140000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk menjadikannya<ns0:br />sesuai untuk pertabalan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p43" begin="1893140000t" end="1915250000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya katakan kita habiskan<ns0:br />esok bersama-sama.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p44" begin="1915250000t" end="1952360000t" region="bottomCenter">esok bersama. Pada<ns0:br />pertabalan. Kami berbelanja</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p45" begin="1952360000t" end="1962370000t" region="bottomCenter">tuhan akan memberi<ns0:br />kita Kami diberkati</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p46" begin="1962370000t" end="1972800000t" region="bottomCenter">dalam hidup kita.<ns0:br />seorang raja baru</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p47" begin="1972800000t" end="1992400000t" region="bottomCenter">Horus?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p48" begin="1992400000t" end="2002830000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda tahu saya tidak<ns0:br />peduli tentang tuhan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p49" begin="2002830000t" end="2016600000t" region="bottomCenter">Nah, mereka mengambil<ns0:br />berat tentang anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p50" begin="2022430000t" end="2043710000t" region="bottomCenter">Bek! Kembalikan.<ns0:br />Oh, ya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p51" begin="2062470000t" end="2074990000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk memakai sesuatu yang<ns0:br />istimewa. Saya tahu awak mahu</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p52" begin="2124620000t" end="2138390000t" region="bottomCenter">Adakah anda mencurinya<ns0:br />daripada seorang pekedai</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p53" begin="2138390000t" end="2156320000t" region="bottomCenter">atau dari almari<ns0:br />seseorang?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p54" begin="2156320000t" end="2171340000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia lebih cepat<ns0:br />daripada menunggu tuhan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p55" begin="2171340000t" end="2183850000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk menjawab<ns0:br />doa saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p56" begin="2218890000t" end="2236400000t" region="bottomCenter">semua yang kita perlukan.<ns0:br />Tuhan memberi kita</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p57" begin="2236400000t" end="2258090000t" region="bottomCenter">ya. Kemurahan hati mereka<ns0:br />tidak mengenal batas.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p58" begin="2271860000t" end="2286030000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGESEH) Awak<ns0:br />nampak cantik.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p59" begin="2305220000t" end="2324820000t" region="bottomCenter">Zaya, apabila saya meminta awak<ns0:br />untuk melarikan diri dengan saya,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p60" begin="2332740000t" end="2346090000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya berjanji kepada<ns0:br />awak kehidupan yang baik.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p61" begin="2351520000t" end="2371120000t" region="bottomCenter">Pakaian yang layak<ns0:br />untuk seorang puteri.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p62" begin="2371120000t" end="2382790000t" region="bottomCenter">Yang baru setiap<ns0:br />hari. (KECIK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p63" begin="2382790000t" end="2402810000t" region="bottomCenter">Sungai-sungai permata<ns0:br />untuk menghiasi anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p64" begin="2402810000t" end="2415330000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk membesarkan keluarga<ns0:br />kita. Sebuah istana emas</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p65" begin="2415330000t" end="2434930000t" region="bottomCenter">Dan berapa ramai anak<ns0:br />yang akan kita ada?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p66" begin="2445780000t" end="2459130000t" region="bottomCenter">(KECIK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p67" begin="2459130000t" end="2471640000t" region="bottomCenter">(LEMBUT) Sedozen.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p68" begin="2475390000t" end="2497910000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya akan lakukan apa sahaja<ns0:br />untuk membahagiakan awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p69" begin="2497910000t" end="2520860000t" region="bottomCenter">ODER BEK: Dan bagaimana<ns0:br />keadaan Horus, bakal raja,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p70" begin="2520860000t" end="2540040000t" region="bottomCenter">bersedia untuk<ns0:br />hari besarnya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p71" begin="2540040000t" end="2556300000t" region="bottomCenter">(Berdengkur)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p72" begin="2597600000t" end="2613020000t" region="bottomCenter">Tuhan Udara.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p73" begin="2631800000t" end="2653060000t" region="bottomCenter">Agak satu majlis<ns0:br />malam tadi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p74" begin="2653060000t" end="2664740000t" region="bottomCenter">Dah ramai tekan<ns0:br />pipi ke pipi</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p75" begin="2664740000t" end="2681850000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk melihat<ns0:br />anda sekilas.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p76" begin="2681850000t" end="2694770000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda akan kelihatan<ns0:br />hebat. HAMBA 2:</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p77" begin="2694770000t" end="2711050000t" region="bottomCenter">(MERENGENG LEMBUT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p78" begin="2711050000t" end="2723130000t" region="bottomCenter">Akhirnya. (KEKEKkekek)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p79" begin="2763170000t" end="2791130000t" region="bottomCenter">♪ Gemilang, mulia<ns0:br />Horus! ♪ HAMBA:</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p80" begin="2791130000t" end="2816980000t" region="bottomCenter">BEK LEBIH TUA: Tetapi<ns0:br />jangan diskaun lagi Horus.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p81" begin="2816980000t" end="2835750000t" region="bottomCenter">kepada nasib dunia<ns0:br />Kerana apabila ia datang</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p82" begin="2835750000t" end="2857020000t" region="bottomCenter">di tangan<ns0:br />seseorang,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p83" begin="2857020000t" end="2882880000t" region="bottomCenter">dengan kekuatan yang mereka<ns0:br />miliki. tuhan pun boleh terkejut</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p84" begin="2885380000t" end="2900400000t" region="bottomCenter">(Mengeluh)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p85" begin="2950030000t" end="2968380000t" region="bottomCenter">Jika saya<ns0:br />dinobatkan,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p86" begin="2968380000t" end="2984230000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya mungkin telah menghabiskan<ns0:br />masa-masa sebelumnya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p87" begin="2984230000t" end="3002590000t" region="bottomCenter">mengarang mesej<ns0:br />untuk umatku.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p88" begin="3002590000t" end="3023430000t" region="bottomCenter">Mungkinkah rakyat<ns0:br />lebih menyayanginya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p89" begin="3023430000t" end="3045540000t" region="bottomCenter">tidak fikir kita perlu Mungkin<ns0:br />Lord Horus ucapan yang membosankan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p90" begin="3045540000t" end="3071410000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk membakar kemuliaannya<ns0:br />sendiri. Kecuali apabila ia datang</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p91" begin="3071410000t" end="3088500000t" region="bottomCenter">Banyak roti<ns0:br />bakar diperlukan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p92" begin="3088500000t" end="3112280000t" region="bottomCenter">lagu mana yang akan dinyanyikan.<ns0:br />Saya sedang melakukan perbuatan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p93" begin="3112280000t" end="3135630000t" region="bottomCenter">Singa besar yang dia bunuh<ns0:br />itu mengganas kampung.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p94" begin="3135630000t" end="3166910000t" region="bottomCenter">Semua lebih layak<ns0:br />lagu. Ia adalah? bagus.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p95" begin="3174420000t" end="3187770000t" region="bottomCenter">(Mengeluh)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p96" begin="3187770000t" end="3202370000t" region="bottomCenter">itu bagus.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p97" begin="3233640000t" end="3249920000t" region="bottomCenter">Tak apa, terima<ns0:br />kasih... (GAGAP)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p98" begin="3258260000t" end="3270350000t" region="bottomCenter">awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p99" begin="3270350000t" end="3293700000t" region="bottomCenter">Sayang saya<ns0:br />datang lambat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p100" begin="3293700000t" end="3321240000t" region="bottomCenter">sedar dan berpakaian.<ns0:br />Tetapi di sini saya,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p101" begin="3327490000t" end="3342090000t" region="bottomCenter">Jangan beritahu<ns0:br />sesiapa.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p102" begin="3342090000t" end="3362110000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya mempunyai reputasi<ns0:br />buruk untuk disimpan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p103" begin="3370870000t" end="3383790000t" region="bottomCenter">(LEMBUT) Mari<ns0:br />sini. Datang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p104" begin="3393800000t" end="3407570000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak. Tidak,<ns0:br />tidak. Tidak, tidak!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p105" begin="3407570000t" end="3416330000t" region="bottomCenter">(JERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p106" begin="3416330000t" end="3430510000t" region="bottomCenter">(TERGAS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p107" begin="3501000000t" end="3526860000t" region="bottomCenter">HATHOR: Sukar untuk dipercayai, tetapi<ns0:br />anda kelihatan seperti seorang raja.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p108" begin="3526860000t" end="3551050000t" region="bottomCenter">Jika itu yang menggembirakan<ns0:br />anda, siapa saya untuk menilai?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p109" begin="3551050000t" end="3565230000t" region="bottomCenter">Barang kemas<ns0:br />mengujakan saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p110" begin="3568980000t" end="3583990000t" region="bottomCenter">Kemudian lihat ke<ns0:br />pergelangan tangan anda,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p111" begin="3583990000t" end="3594000000t" region="bottomCenter">tidaklah terlalu<ns0:br />hebat. jika usaha</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p112" begin="3594000000t" end="3617780000t" region="bottomCenter">Gelang 42<ns0:br />Bintang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p113" begin="3617780000t" end="3645720000t" region="bottomCenter">Untuk mengingatkan anda tentang<ns0:br />syaitan yang saya bunuh untuk anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p114" begin="3645720000t" end="3666160000t" region="bottomCenter">Khazanah yang lebih berharga<ns0:br />Mesir tidak pernah tahu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p115" begin="3666160000t" end="3685760000t" region="bottomCenter">Perkara<ns0:br />lama ini?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p116" begin="3685760000t" end="3709120000t" region="bottomCenter">Bagaimana Dewi Cinta<ns0:br />tidak tahu apa itu cinta?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p117" begin="3709120000t" end="3740410000t" region="bottomCenter">yang mengibaskan bulu matanya, Ia<ns0:br />bukan tempat tidur mana-mana gadis</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p118" begin="3740410000t" end="3764170000t" region="bottomCenter">pembunuh singa<ns0:br />yang perkasa.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p119" begin="3764170000t" end="3794620000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya sedang meraikan pemburuan itu. Anda<ns0:br />akan tahu sekiranya anda berada di sini.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p120" begin="3794620000t" end="3824230000t" region="bottomCenter">Binatang mati kurang begitu.<ns0:br />Saya menghargai kebebasan saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p121" begin="3824230000t" end="3843010000t" region="bottomCenter">masalah memakainya. Nah,<ns0:br />anda tidak mempunyai</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p122" begin="3843010000t" end="3865110000t" region="bottomCenter">Hathor,<ns0:br />jangan. Oh...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p123" begin="3865110000t" end="3884290000t" region="bottomCenter">jangan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p124" begin="3884290000t" end="3903490000t" region="bottomCenter">Itu bukan cara untuk<ns0:br />seorang ratu berkelakuan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p125" begin="3903490000t" end="3928090000t" region="bottomCenter">Kemudian ia adalah perkara yang<ns0:br />baik saya bukan seorang permaisuri.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p126" begin="3928090000t" end="3949360000t" region="bottomCenter">apa-apa lagi membosankan Bolehkah<ns0:br />anda bayangkan daripada duduk</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p127" begin="3949360000t" end="3961460000t" region="bottomCenter">di atas takhta<ns0:br />sepanjang hari?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p128" begin="3998580000t" end="4014000000t" region="bottomCenter">awak tanya saya?<ns0:br />Apa sebenarnya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p129" begin="4029030000t" end="4044030000t" region="bottomCenter">Ada saya tanya<ns0:br />awak sesuatu?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p130" begin="4061560000t" end="4074060000t" region="bottomCenter">saya tak pasti.<ns0:br />Adakah anda</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p131" begin="4124530000t" end="4135800000t" region="bottomCenter">HAMBA: Tuanku.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p132" begin="4142480000t" end="4154560000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia bermula.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p133" begin="4257170000t" end="4271350000t" region="bottomCenter">(Mengeluh)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p134" begin="4341840000t" end="4355180000t" region="bottomCenter">(PUKUL DRAM)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p135" begin="4385210000t" end="4402320000t" region="bottomCenter">(ORANG BERSORAK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p136" begin="4512850000t" end="4524930000t" region="bottomCenter">(BURUNG BERKICANG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p137" begin="4658820000t" end="4705110000t" region="bottomCenter">Hathor,<ns0:br />Dewi Cinta!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p138" begin="4705110000t" end="4720130000t" region="bottomCenter">(ORANG RAMAI<ns0:br />BERTEPUK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p139" begin="4836910000t" end="4885290000t" region="bottomCenter">Dewi Perlindungan!<ns0:br />Nephthys,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p140" begin="4941190000t" end="4954950000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p141" begin="4963300000t" end="4976640000t" region="bottomCenter">Tuan. Oh...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p142" begin="4979980000t" end="4995820000t" region="bottomCenter">Terima kasih,<ns0:br />anak muda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p143" begin="5014180000t" end="5035440000t" region="bottomCenter">baik kepada orang yang tidak dikenali<ns0:br />hari ini. Anda telah sangat teruk</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p144" begin="5035440000t" end="5047960000t" region="bottomCenter">Tunjukkan<ns0:br />tangan awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p145" begin="5070070000t" end="5088420000t" region="bottomCenter">apa? Hadiah<ns0:br />untuk Osiris.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p146" begin="5088420000t" end="5101770000t" region="bottomCenter">ZAYA: Cepatlah!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p147" begin="5105510000t" end="5138470000t" region="bottomCenter">Thoth, Tuhan<ns0:br />Kebijaksanaan!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p148" begin="5189770000t" end="5211880000t" region="bottomCenter">Salam, Thoth.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p149" begin="5211880000t" end="5235640000t" region="bottomCenter">bahawa bekas pelajar anda<ns0:br />Pernahkah anda bayangkan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p150" begin="5235640000t" end="5248160000t" region="bottomCenter">adakah suatu hari nanti<ns0:br />akan memakai mahkota Mesir?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p151" begin="5265670000t" end="5294040000t" region="bottomCenter">pelbagai sifat,<ns0:br />Horus evinced</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p152" begin="5294040000t" end="5315310000t" region="bottomCenter">beberapa daripadanya mungkin merupakan<ns0:br />jawatan kepimpinan. kaitkan dengan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p153" begin="5322400000t" end="5335330000t" region="bottomCenter">Jika dia<ns0:br />bernasib baik.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p154" begin="5344090000t" end="5359940000t" region="bottomCenter">(TUMPET TIUP)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p155" begin="5359940000t" end="5395390000t" region="bottomCenter">Puji Osiris!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p156" begin="5403740000t" end="5415820000t" region="bottomCenter">(ORANG BERSORAK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p157" begin="5415820000t" end="5448360000t" region="bottomCenter">Raja seluruh<ns0:br />Mesir!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p158" begin="5465870000t" end="5495900000t" region="bottomCenter">Salam Ra,<ns0:br />Tuhan Cahaya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p159" begin="5495900000t" end="5523020000t" region="bottomCenter">SEMUA: Salam<ns0:br />Ra, Tuan Cahaya!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p160" begin="5535940000t" end="5565560000t" region="bottomCenter">patut untuk memberkati hari<ns0:br />ini Ayah saya telah melihat</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p161" begin="5577650000t" end="5607270000t" region="bottomCenter">kerana anda semua memberkati<ns0:br />kami dengan kemurahan hati anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p162" begin="5667740000t" end="5690690000t" region="bottomCenter">seseorang yang mempunyai<ns0:br />banyak. Token daripada</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p163" begin="5706110000t" end="5725720000t" region="bottomCenter">Dan dari seseorang<ns0:br />yang mempunyai sedikit.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p164" begin="5746150000t" end="5771600000t" region="bottomCenter">dan berdiri di Gerbang Akhir,<ns0:br />Tetapi apabila kedua-duanya mati</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p165" begin="5782450000t" end="5803300000t" region="bottomCenter">apakah nilai<ns0:br />mereka kemudian?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p166" begin="5803300000t" end="5825410000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya katakan<ns0:br />mereka sama rata.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p167" begin="5825410000t" end="5851260000t" region="bottomCenter">Simbol kehidupan<ns0:br />yang baik.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p168" begin="5866270000t" end="5895890000t" region="bottomCenter">ke alam Akhirat.<ns0:br />Semua dialu-alukan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p169" begin="5912580000t" end="5926330000t" region="bottomCenter">Ini adalah<ns0:br />warisan saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p170" begin="5936340000t" end="5975560000t" region="bottomCenter">kami menobatkan raja<ns0:br />baru. Tetapi hari ini,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p171" begin="5975560000t" end="6006410000t" region="bottomCenter">dia akan mempunyai warisan Dan<ns0:br />suatu hari nanti, dia sendiri.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p172" begin="6006410000t" end="6038530000t" region="bottomCenter">Tuhan Udara.<ns0:br />Anak saya Horus,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p173" begin="6038530000t" end="6056460000t" region="bottomCenter">(ORANG MERAUNG<ns0:br />DAN BERTEPUK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p174" begin="6177000000t" end="6193270000t" region="bottomCenter">Adakah anda<ns0:br />bersedia? (Berbisik)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p175" begin="6201200000t" end="6215380000t" region="bottomCenter">saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p176" begin="6265850000t" end="6279610000t" region="bottomCenter">SET: Tunggu!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p177" begin="6279610000t" end="6293370000t" region="bottomCenter">Tunggu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p178" begin="6293370000t" end="6312980000t" region="bottomCenter">Maaf saya<ns0:br />lambat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p179" begin="6312980000t" end="6339670000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk menyeberangi padang<ns0:br />pasir. Eh, tiga hari</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p180" begin="6339670000t" end="6370950000t" region="bottomCenter">Dan hampir satu lagi untuk<ns0:br />melewati semua peminat anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p181" begin="6370950000t" end="6385550000t" region="bottomCenter">(KERAMAI KETAWA)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p182" begin="6386790000t" end="6401400000t" region="bottomCenter">Set!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p183" begin="6401400000t" end="6422670000t" region="bottomCenter">Senang jumpa<ns0:br />awak. Abang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p184" begin="6422670000t" end="6437680000t" region="bottomCenter">Dan awak,<ns0:br />abang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p185" begin="6437680000t" end="6456450000t" region="bottomCenter">tempat untuk anda di<ns0:br />sini. sentiasa ada</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p186" begin="6469800000t" end="6491900000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda mesti bangga. Hari yang<ns0:br />begitu besar untuk keluarga.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p187" begin="6500660000t" end="6516920000t" region="bottomCenter">saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p188" begin="6516920000t" end="6548620000t" region="bottomCenter">Tengok awak, anak<ns0:br />saudara. Hebat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p189" begin="6548620000t" end="6560300000t" region="bottomCenter">di sini akan menjadi raja<ns0:br />yang baik. Sekurang-kurangnya seseorang</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p190" begin="6566970000t" end="6581580000t" region="bottomCenter">anda tidak akan<ns0:br />datang. Saya takut</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p191" begin="6581580000t" end="6594930000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak, saya tidak<ns0:br />akan terlepas.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p192" begin="6594930000t" end="6606600000t" region="bottomCenter">Ah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p193" begin="6617860000t" end="6633300000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk<ns0:br />awak. Oh...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p194" begin="6651650000t" end="6675840000t" region="bottomCenter">Tanduk memburu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p195" begin="6675840000t" end="6707110000t" region="bottomCenter">seekor domba jantan yang meratakan 10 tuhan<ns0:br />lebih lambat daripada saya. Dari tengkorak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p196" begin="6707110000t" end="6722970000t" region="bottomCenter">memang cantik.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p197" begin="6722970000t" end="6736720000t" region="bottomCenter">ya? Cubalah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p198" begin="6780110000t" end="6793870000t" region="bottomCenter">Dari Set.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p199" begin="6793870000t" end="6806790000t" region="bottomCenter">(ORANG BERSORAK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p200" begin="6816400000t" end="6843920000t" region="bottomCenter">Biar Ra sendiri<ns0:br />mendengar awak. Ayuh!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p201" begin="6867270000t" end="6886050000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENIPU TUNDA)<ns0:br />(BERSORAK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p202" begin="6942350000t" end="6957780000t" region="bottomCenter">(LELAKI MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p203" begin="6957780000t" end="6982390000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya rasa seseorang<ns0:br />mendengar anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p204" begin="6982390000t" end="6994490000t" region="bottomCenter">(JAJAK KAKI<ns0:br />BERARAH)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p205" begin="7217620000t" end="7232230000t" region="bottomCenter">Apa ini,<ns0:br />Set?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p206" begin="7268090000t" end="7282280000t" region="bottomCenter">(ASKAR TERJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p207" begin="7287690000t" end="7300210000t" region="bottomCenter">(BERKEPING)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p208" begin="7316900000t" end="7327730000t" region="bottomCenter">(ASKAR-ASKAR MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p209" begin="7345680000t" end="7357760000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda mengenalinya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p210" begin="7397800000t" end="7410320000t" region="bottomCenter">Ayah memberikannya<ns0:br />kepada kamu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p211" begin="7430760000t" end="7461200000t" region="bottomCenter">Membuat saya hidup selama<ns0:br />beberapa malam di padang pasir.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p212" begin="7491650000t" end="7507910000t" region="bottomCenter">Lawan saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p213" begin="7507910000t" end="7521260000t" region="bottomCenter">Jauhi ini, nak.<ns0:br />Ayah, jangan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p214" begin="7537120000t" end="7554630000t" region="bottomCenter">kenapa?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p215" begin="7554630000t" end="7593840000t" region="bottomCenter">apa yang telah anda capai?<ns0:br />Dalam 1,000 tahun damai,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p216" begin="7593840000t" end="7628030000t" region="bottomCenter">yang tidak bermimpi<ns0:br />lagi. Tanah orang</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p217" begin="7628030000t" end="7642640000t" region="bottomCenter">Sekarang<ns0:br />giliran saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p218" begin="7642640000t" end="7662240000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak<ns0:br />akan melawan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p219" begin="7662240000t" end="7684760000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya sayang awak, abang.<ns0:br />Dengan sepenuh hati saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p220" begin="7712290000t" end="7736070000t" region="bottomCenter">(ISIS TERGAS)<ns0:br />ORANG ramai: Tidak!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p221" begin="7736070000t" end="7748990000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya sayang awak<ns0:br />juga, abang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p222" begin="7770680000t" end="7784860000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p223" begin="7796130000t" end="7808210000t" region="bottomCenter">ISIS: Osiris!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p224" begin="7858260000t" end="7892470000t" region="bottomCenter">Nah, ini benar-benar untuk<ns0:br />keluarga. adalah hari yang besar</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p225" begin="7908310000t" end="7925840000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya, Set,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p226" begin="7945440000t" end="7967550000t" region="bottomCenter">akan menjadi<ns0:br />rajamu yang sejati.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p227" begin="7974640000t" end="7999240000t" region="bottomCenter">Raja seluruh<ns0:br />Mesir!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p228" begin="7999240000t" end="8030940000t" region="bottomCenter">daripada mereka yang berdiri<ns0:br />Lihatlah nasib di jalan saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p229" begin="8044290000t" end="8058040000t" region="bottomCenter">Tuhan...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p230" begin="8073070000t" end="8097260000t" region="bottomCenter">Tunduklah di hadapan<ns0:br />saya atau mati.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p231" begin="8137720000t" end="8178160000t" region="bottomCenter">Manusia, sembahlah aku<ns0:br />atau jadilah hamba!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p232" begin="8213620000t" end="8228210000t" region="bottomCenter">(OMONGAN MENGGUGUH)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p233" begin="8241150000t" end="8260750000t" region="bottomCenter">(LEMBUT) Bek!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p234" begin="8260750000t" end="8288270000t" region="bottomCenter">akhirat adalah<ns0:br />anugerah. Abang fikir</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p235" begin="8301210000t" end="8328310000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya fikir seorang raja harus<ns0:br />mempunyai standard yang lebih tinggi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p236" begin="8338740000t" end="8362940000t" region="bottomCenter">anda perlu membeli Mulai<ns0:br />sekarang, cara anda masuk</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p237" begin="8362940000t" end="8377960000t" region="bottomCenter">dengan kekayaan<ns0:br />yang diperolehi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p238" begin="8408810000t" end="8428830000t" region="bottomCenter">(BERNAFAS TERGEGAR)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p239" begin="8428830000t" end="8452190000t" region="bottomCenter">baru sahaja bermula.<ns0:br />perjalanan awak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p240" begin="8467630000t" end="8481810000t" region="bottomCenter">(TERKESAK) (TERESAK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p241" begin="8558960000t" end="8571480000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENANGIS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p242" begin="8624030000t" end="8638630000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia milik anda<ns0:br />sekarang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p243" begin="8655730000t" end="8674080000t" region="bottomCenter">tetapi sekarang bukan masanya. Ramai di<ns0:br />antara kami akan berdiri bersama anda,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p244" begin="8731640000t" end="8749150000t" region="bottomCenter">-Saya memandang tinggi kepada<ns0:br />awak. -Sudah tentu anda lakukan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p245" begin="8755420000t" end="8768760000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p246" begin="8779180000t" end="8793370000t" region="bottomCenter">Itu tidak<ns0:br />bijak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p247" begin="8853430000t" end="8869270000t" region="bottomCenter">anda masih tidak pernah<ns0:br />rindu? Adakah ia benar</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p248" begin="8869270000t" end="8883460000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidakkah itu<ns0:br />menjadi membosankan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p249" begin="8916410000t" end="8933510000t" region="bottomCenter">(ORANG TERKESAK)<ns0:br />(SET KETAWA)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p250" begin="8933510000t" end="8946440000t" region="bottomCenter">penglihatan adalah<ns0:br />sempurna. Saya fikir awak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p251" begin="9056130000t" end="9069060000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p252" begin="9147480000t" end="9159560000t" region="bottomCenter">(KEDUA-DUA MENDERENG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p253" begin="9209610000t" end="9221710000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda berlawan<ns0:br />dengan baik.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p254" begin="9230050000t" end="9246320000t" region="bottomCenter">Adakah anda pasti<ns0:br />anda anaknya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p255" begin="9347680000t" end="9359760000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENYEDUT TAMAT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p256" begin="9378540000t" end="9390630000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p257" begin="9429830000t" end="9442350000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p258" begin="9466540000t" end="9479470000t" region="bottomCenter">(MERENGANG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p259" begin="9530350000t" end="9545370000t" region="bottomCenter">(ORANG RAMAI<ns0:br />MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p260" begin="9716380000t" end="9729720000t" region="bottomCenter">(SET MENGERUM)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p261" begin="9835240000t" end="9849430000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia akan!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p262" begin="9860260000t" end="9875700000t" region="bottomCenter">Tunggu! Zaya!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p263" begin="9881120000t" end="9890710000t" region="bottomCenter">Pembela!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p264" begin="9890710000t" end="9907820000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p265" begin="9918250000t" end="9934510000t" region="bottomCenter">(ASKAR TERJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p266" begin="9934510000t" end="9949110000t" region="bottomCenter">(HORUS mendengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p267" begin="10203530000t" end="10233560000t" region="bottomCenter">Awak tak layak jadi Raja.<ns0:br />Saya membantu Mesir.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p268" begin="10248990000t" end="10260660000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERING)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p269" begin="10300700000t" end="10315310000t" region="bottomCenter">(HORUS TERUS<ns0:br />MENGERANG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p270" begin="10353680000t" end="10376620000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENJERIT) Tidak!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p271" begin="10376620000t" end="10390380000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p272" begin="10447940000t" end="10464200000t" region="bottomCenter">(HORUS MENGERANG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p273" begin="10513000000t" end="10530520000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENANGIS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p274" begin="10563470000t" end="10577650000t" region="bottomCenter">Set!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p275" begin="10739900000t" end="10750740000t" region="bottomCenter">(LEMBUT) Maafkan<ns0:br />saya, Bapa.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p276" begin="10771170000t" end="10786190000t" region="bottomCenter">(ASKAR MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p277" begin="10812880000t" end="10828320000t" region="bottomCenter">(GROWLES)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p278" begin="10828320000t" end="10840830000t" region="bottomCenter">BEK: Zaya!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p279" begin="10844170000t" end="10858350000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia akan!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p280" begin="10924250000t" end="10958450000t" region="bottomCenter">Jadi Set adalah<ns0:br />Raja. BEK LAMA:</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p281" begin="10958450000t" end="10994320000t" region="bottomCenter">banyak tuhan menentangnya.<ns0:br />Pada tahun berikutnya,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p282" begin="10994320000t" end="11034360000t" region="bottomCenter">mereka membayar dengan<ns0:br />nyawa mereka. satu persatu,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p283" begin="11034360000t" end="11061460000t" region="bottomCenter">keadaan menjadi lebih<ns0:br />teruk. Untuk manusia,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p284" begin="11070230000t" end="11091490000t" region="bottomCenter">Kebanyakan dipaksa<ns0:br />menjadi hamba,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p285" begin="11091490000t" end="11111510000t" region="bottomCenter">sen terkecil dan<ns0:br />dinafikan walaupun</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p286" begin="11111510000t" end="11141540000t" region="bottomCenter">ke alam Akhirat. untuk<ns0:br />membeli cara kami</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p287" begin="11141540000t" end="11181580000t" region="bottomCenter">Horus berundur ke dalam<ns0:br />buangan. Buta dan kalah,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p288" begin="11181580000t" end="11203690000t" region="bottomCenter">Mereka yang berdoa untuknya<ns0:br />menyelamatkan Mesir</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p289" begin="11203690000t" end="11221210000t" region="bottomCenter">sangat kecewa.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p290" begin="11230390000t" end="11256660000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi saya tidak pernah<ns0:br />banyak untuk solat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p291" begin="11256660000t" end="11282940000t" region="bottomCenter">menjadi hamba kepada tuan yang<ns0:br />kejam. Saya telah menemui Zaya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p292" begin="11301700000t" end="11330490000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi bagaimana saya boleh<ns0:br />membebaskannya daripada semua ini?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p293" begin="11330490000t" end="11352590000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia adalah rancangan<ns0:br />yang paling gila.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p294" begin="11482300000t" end="11501900000t" region="bottomCenter">kawal angin, Zaya,<ns0:br />Anda mungkin tidak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p295" begin="11501900000t" end="11517340000t" region="bottomCenter">boleh menutup pengatup.<ns0:br />tetapi saya fikir awak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p296" begin="11524430000t" end="11539030000t" region="bottomCenter">Maaf, Tuanku.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p297" begin="11566560000t" end="11602000000t" region="bottomCenter">Cantik, jika saya mendapati<ns0:br />meja saya tidak teratur lagi,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p298" begin="11602000000t" end="11620360000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya akan baling awak ke<ns0:br />luar untuk menolak batu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p299" begin="11620360000t" end="11632870000t" region="bottomCenter">Adakah<ns0:br />itu jelas?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p300" begin="11687930000t" end="11703360000t" region="bottomCenter">URSHU: Ayuh, ayuh! Tidak<ns0:br />mendapat sepanjang hari.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p301" begin="11756330000t" end="11781360000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya ingin menjatuhkannya dari<ns0:br />ketinggian yang tinggi. (KECEWA)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p302" begin="11781360000t" end="11800540000t" region="bottomCenter">Pagi. (KECEWA)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p303" begin="11800540000t" end="11815140000t" region="bottomCenter">(URSHU DESA)<ns0:br />(WHIPLASH)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p304" begin="11815140000t" end="11837240000t" region="bottomCenter">Satu hari nanti, saya<ns0:br />akan rampas awak dari dia.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p305" begin="11837240000t" end="11853920000t" region="bottomCenter">selalu jawapannya?<ns0:br />ZAYA: Adakah kecurian</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p306" begin="11853920000t" end="11880210000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda sama ada kaya atau tidak.<ns0:br />Ia kini berada di dunia ini.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p307" begin="11880210000t" end="11893550000t" region="bottomCenter">(TERKECAK LEMBUT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p308" begin="11898140000t" end="11914400000t" region="bottomCenter">Walaupun awak boleh<ns0:br />membebaskan saya,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p309" begin="11914400000t" end="11941520000t" region="bottomCenter">bagaimana dengan keluarga<ns0:br />saya? kawan kita?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p310" begin="11941520000t" end="11962360000t" region="bottomCenter">Bolehkah anda mencuri<ns0:br />semua Mesir dari Set?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p311" begin="11962360000t" end="11983220000t" region="bottomCenter">Hanya Horus yang boleh<ns0:br />membebaskan kita. (SCOFFS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p312" begin="11983220000t" end="11999490000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda benar-benar<ns0:br />percaya tuhan peduli?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p313" begin="11999490000t" end="12012000000t" region="bottomCenter">Jika Horus boleh<ns0:br />datang, dia akan datang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p314" begin="12024090000t" end="12039950000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya nak<ns0:br />tunjukkan sesuatu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p315" begin="12122520000t" end="12148810000t" region="bottomCenter">ZAYA: Tentera Set pulang<ns0:br />membawa rampasan perang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p316" begin="12148810000t" end="12162980000t" region="bottomCenter">Bilik kebalnya akan<ns0:br />dibuka malam ini.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p317" begin="12162980000t" end="12177170000t" region="bottomCenter">Masa yang<ns0:br />sesuai</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p318" begin="12177170000t" end="12190930000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk menyelinap<ns0:br />masuk. untuk seseorang</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p319" begin="12190930000t" end="12207200000t" region="bottomCenter">kenapa?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p320" begin="12207200000t" end="12229720000t" region="bottomCenter">Mereka mengatakan mata<ns0:br />Horus disimpan di sana.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p321" begin="12229720000t" end="12242640000t" region="bottomCenter">kuasanya lagi.<ns0:br />Dia akan mempunyai</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p322" begin="12242640000t" end="12257660000t" region="bottomCenter">Mencuri<ns0:br />dari tuhan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p323" begin="12257660000t" end="12282680000t" region="bottomCenter">Hanya orang gila yang akan<ns0:br />mencuba perkara sedemikian.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p324" begin="12282680000t" end="12302290000t" region="bottomCenter">kita boleh cari seseorang yang<ns0:br />sangat marah? Mana agaknya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p325" begin="12318560000t" end="12335660000t" region="bottomCenter">Perancangan sepatutnya<ns0:br />ada di sini.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p326" begin="12335660000t" end="12352340000t" region="bottomCenter">Urshu membina peti<ns0:br />besi. Dia arkitek Set.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p327" begin="12369030000t" end="12383200000t" region="bottomCenter">Apa ini?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p328" begin="12390720000t" end="12402390000t" region="bottomCenter">Eh, piramid<ns0:br />pasir Set.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p329" begin="12424490000t" end="12442840000t" region="bottomCenter">BEK: Dia telah membina dirinya<ns0:br />sendiri sebagai lubang api.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p330" begin="12442840000t" end="12464530000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia mesti memasak<ns0:br />jamuan besar-besaran.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p331" begin="12464530000t" end="12482880000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia adalah lubang<ns0:br />ke pusat dunia.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p332" begin="12482880000t" end="12507500000t" region="bottomCenter">Sumber kuasanya.<ns0:br />Tiada kenduri.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p333" begin="12521260000t" end="12532520000t" region="bottomCenter">Terjumpa.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p334" begin="12546700000t" end="12572970000t" region="bottomCenter">Harta itu akan melalui<ns0:br />pintu pagar hadapan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p335" begin="12572970000t" end="12582980000t" region="bottomCenter">bukan masalahnya.<ns0:br />Pintu pagar hadapan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p336" begin="12582980000t" end="12603000000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia adalah apa yang<ns0:br />datang selepas.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p337" begin="12603000000t" end="12623020000t" region="bottomCenter">diikat dengan<ns0:br />perangkap. Dua jambatan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p338" begin="12623020000t" end="12633450000t" region="bottomCenter">daripada mereka tanpa<ns0:br />henti. Urshu bermegah</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p339" begin="12642220000t" end="12655140000t" region="bottomCenter">Nasib baik<ns0:br />saya menipu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p340" begin="12803200000t" end="12817390000t" region="bottomCenter">betul, askar.<ns0:br />Selamat datang saya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p341" begin="12833230000t" end="12852010000t" region="bottomCenter">Ratu Mesir menunggu.<ns0:br />jangan simpan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p342" begin="13005070000t" end="13030100000t" region="bottomCenter">SET: Saya rasa awak<ns0:br />merindui saya. (KECEWA)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p343" begin="13030100000t" end="13053450000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya mesti<ns0:br />rindu awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p344" begin="13053450000t" end="13065550000t" region="bottomCenter">Lagipun saya<ns0:br />banduan awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p345" begin="13065550000t" end="13084320000t" region="bottomCenter">Oh, penjara ini<ns0:br />tidak begitu teruk.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p346" begin="13084320000t" end="13100170000t" region="bottomCenter">Well, saya<ns0:br />sengsara.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p347" begin="13113930000t" end="13129790000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda mempunyai cara yang<ns0:br />lucu untuk menunjukkannya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p348" begin="13133530000t" end="13157310000t" region="bottomCenter">Bolehkah saya<ns0:br />meminjam pisau anda?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p349" begin="13157310000t" end="13199860000t" region="bottomCenter">Jadi jika anda mempunyai<ns0:br />peluang, anda akan membunuh saya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p350" begin="13209450000t" end="13221960000t" region="bottomCenter">Bagaimana saya<ns0:br />boleh membunuh awak?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p351" begin="13235300000t" end="13251160000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi anda akan<ns0:br />melakukannya jika anda boleh.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p352" begin="13263660000t" end="13280350000t" region="bottomCenter">Lebih baik buka<ns0:br />mata. (Berbisik)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p353" begin="13383780000t" end="13395880000t" region="bottomCenter">Set Tuhan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p354" begin="13403800000t" end="13418410000t" region="bottomCenter">(KETAWA) Oh...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p355" begin="13418410000t" end="13433010000t" region="bottomCenter">Dan, eh...<ns0:br />Puan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p356" begin="13443840000t" end="13463860000t" region="bottomCenter">datang pada masa yang lebih<ns0:br />baik. Mungkin saya boleh</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p357" begin="13463860000t" end="13484720000t" region="bottomCenter">SET: Tidak, masuklah.<ns0:br />Jangan malu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p358" begin="13484720000t" end="13500160000t" region="bottomCenter">(SET MENGELUPASKAN)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p359" begin="13524760000t" end="13538940000t" region="bottomCenter">Ayuh.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p360" begin="13614010000t" end="13654050000t" region="bottomCenter">Tiada siapa yang pernah<ns0:br />begitu menghormati Tuhan Ra.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p361" begin="13654050000t" end="13677830000t" region="bottomCenter">di atas puncaknya dan<ns0:br />keajaiban Dia akan berlalu</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p362" begin="13677830000t" end="13695350000t" region="bottomCenter">pada penghormatan yang telah<ns0:br />kamu bina dalam nama-Nya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p363" begin="13710780000t" end="13723700000t" region="bottomCenter">Adakah itu?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p364" begin="13732470000t" end="13745400000t" region="bottomCenter">saya minta<ns0:br />maaf?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p365" begin="13753330000t" end="13766250000t" region="bottomCenter">Nah, bolehkah anda<ns0:br />menjadikannya lebih tinggi?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p366" begin="13785020000t" end="13800460000t" region="bottomCenter">Lebih tinggi?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p367" begin="13800460000t" end="13825060000t" region="bottomCenter">Ya, ia adalah<ns0:br />soalan mudah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p368" begin="13825060000t" end="13843820000t" region="bottomCenter">itu mungkin sukar,<ns0:br />emm, (GAGAP) Nah,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p369" begin="13854250000t" end="13871360000t" region="bottomCenter">sekarang,<ns0:br />maksud saya...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p370" begin="13871360000t" end="13889710000t" region="bottomCenter">Tenang, Urshu.<ns0:br />Saya bergurau.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p371" begin="13902640000t" end="13914310000t" region="bottomCenter">(KETAWA)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p372" begin="13924320000t" end="13937260000t" region="bottomCenter">beritahu saya,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p373" begin="13948100000t" end="13974370000t" region="bottomCenter">kenapa bapa kamu memilih kamu<ns0:br />untuk menjadi pembina tuan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p374" begin="13974370000t" end="13996900000t" region="bottomCenter">salah seorang abang<ns0:br />awak? bukannya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p375" begin="13996900000t" end="14020260000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya rasa kerana saya terbukti<ns0:br />menjadi yang terbaik, Tuhanku.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p376" begin="14020260000t" end="14045280000t" region="bottomCenter">menjadi yang terbaik buat ayah.<ns0:br />Seperti yang saya akan buktikan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p377" begin="14064460000t" end="14098250000t" region="bottomCenter">dari subuh hingga senja.<ns0:br />Dia akan melihatnya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p378" begin="14098250000t" end="14115770000t" region="bottomCenter">bernilai lebih daripada<ns0:br />emas. kepuasan anda</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p379" begin="14124520000t" end="14144540000t" region="bottomCenter">Oh, emas,<ns0:br />emas!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p380" begin="14144540000t" end="14159560000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda akan mempunyai banyak untuk<ns0:br />Kehidupan Akhirat. emas secukupnya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p381" begin="14159560000t" end="14173330000t" region="bottomCenter">Dan roti<ns0:br />bakar!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p382" begin="14182920000t" end="14199600000t" region="bottomCenter">Kepada pembina<ns0:br />terhebat Mesir.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p383" begin="14219620000t" end="14247980000t" region="bottomCenter">Roti bakar untuk<ns0:br />legasi saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p384" begin="14264660000t" end="14277180000t" region="bottomCenter">(GAJAH TRUMPET)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p385" begin="14409810000t" end="14424000000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p386" begin="14471960000t" end="14484880000t" region="bottomCenter">(BERNAFAS BERAT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p387" begin="14794370000t" end="14806460000t" region="bottomCenter">(BEK MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p388" begin="14821480000t" end="14834810000t" region="bottomCenter">Whoa!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p389" begin="14842330000t" end="14854830000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p390" begin="15000400000t" end="15014990000t" region="bottomCenter">(BERCERITA)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p391" begin="15027510000t" end="15043780000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p392" begin="15054630000t" end="15069640000t" region="bottomCenter">dapat kala jengking sebanyak<ns0:br />itu? Di mana anda juga</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p393" begin="15426240000t" end="15446680000t" region="bottomCenter">Cukup untuk membuat anda takut<ns0:br />pada bayang-bayang anda sendiri.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p394" begin="15746140000t" end="15765740000t" region="bottomCenter">"Bulatan adalah<ns0:br />pencetus."</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p395" begin="15794950000t" end="15807460000t" region="bottomCenter">Jadi saya akan<ns0:br />pergi pusingan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p396" begin="15851250000t" end="15867520000t" region="bottomCenter">Nah, itu<ns0:br />mudah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p397" begin="15896290000t" end="15909230000t" region="bottomCenter">(BERGERAK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p398" begin="16140710000t" end="16155730000t" region="bottomCenter">(BERNAFAS TERGEGAR)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p399" begin="16175750000t" end="16187840000t" region="bottomCenter">(TERHANGAT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p400" begin="16233300000t" end="16246220000t" region="bottomCenter">Jambatan ketiga.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p401" begin="16279600000t" end="16298780000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak mengatakan apa-apa<ns0:br />tentang jambatan ketiga.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p402" begin="16316710000t" end="16329650000t" region="bottomCenter">Ini penjenayah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p403" begin="16349670000t" end="16363850000t" region="bottomCenter">Dan hanya<ns0:br />satu mata.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p404" begin="16410560000t" end="16427660000t" region="bottomCenter">Hebat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p405" begin="16427660000t" end="16462280000t" region="bottomCenter">Zaya, awak akan berdoa,<ns0:br />saya akan gulung tulang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p406" begin="16492730000t" end="16506480000t" region="bottomCenter">(BERGERAK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p407" begin="16576970000t" end="16589490000t" region="bottomCenter">(JERENG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p408" begin="16671660000t" end="16686260000t" region="bottomCenter">(JENGKENG KENGKENG<ns0:br />BERCERITA)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p409" begin="16689590000t" end="16703770000t" region="bottomCenter">(TERGAS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p410" begin="16770920000t" end="16784690000t" region="bottomCenter">(KECIK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p411" begin="16865600000t" end="16877270000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia akan!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p412" begin="16897290000t" end="16909810000t" region="bottomCenter">(BERBISIK) Saya<ns0:br />minta maaf.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p413" begin="16944010000t" end="16976950000t" region="bottomCenter">tidak mencukupi... Seolah-olah menggunakan<ns0:br />rumah saya untuk perzinaan kamu</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p414" begin="17027420000t" end="17042860000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda berani mencuri<ns0:br />daripada Raja?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p415" begin="17110430000t" end="17140460000t" region="bottomCenter">di pejabat yang teratur,<ns0:br />Zaya. Saya bangga diri</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p416" begin="17156730000t" end="17183420000t" region="bottomCenter">faham itu, adakah anda?<ns0:br />Awak tak pernah buat</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p417" begin="17183420000t" end="17207600000t" region="bottomCenter">Oh, dan perhiasan kecil<ns0:br />awak yang menyedihkan ini</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p418" begin="17207600000t" end="17227620000t" region="bottomCenter">awak, saya takut. tidak<ns0:br />akan menyelamatkan kedua-duanya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p419" begin="17227620000t" end="17241810000t" region="bottomCenter">(LEMBUT) Set<ns0:br />adalah tuhan anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p420" begin="17241810000t" end="17257240000t" region="bottomCenter">-Itu semua idea<ns0:br />saya. -Pembohong!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p421" begin="17317710000t" end="17332730000t" region="bottomCenter">apa yang anda ambil.<ns0:br />Kembalikan saya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p422" begin="17399460000t" end="17416990000t" region="bottomCenter">terima kasih.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p423" begin="17432420000t" end="17451180000t" region="bottomCenter">kepada serigala.<ns0:br />-Makan mereka -Tunggu!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p424" begin="17464530000t" end="17486220000t" region="bottomCenter">(BERNAFAS BERAT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p425" begin="17486220000t" end="17503320000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya mengambil sesuatu<ns0:br />yang lain. (URSHU MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p426" begin="17553790000t" end="17569220000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus) Lari!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p427" begin="17632620000t" end="17644710000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENANGKUNG<ns0:br />KUDA) (Mendesak)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p428" begin="17751070000t" end="17776930000t" region="bottomCenter">(KECEWA) Awak berjaya.<ns0:br />mana yang lain?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p429" begin="17789850000t" end="17808620000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda tahu betapa sukarnya<ns0:br />untuk mencuri yang itu?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p430" begin="17808620000t" end="17823220000t" region="bottomCenter">(KEDUANYA KETAWA)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p431" begin="17848240000t" end="17860760000t" region="bottomCenter">(TERGAS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p432" begin="17885370000t" end="17897880000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p433" begin="17990470000t" end="18005490000t" region="bottomCenter">(Tercungap-cungap)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p434" begin="18005490000t" end="18018000000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya akan sayang<ns0:br />awak selamanya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p435" begin="18021340000t" end="18033430000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia akan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p436" begin="18033430000t" end="18048030000t" region="bottomCenter">Kematian<ns0:br />bukanlah penamat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p437" begin="18050950000t" end="18065130000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia akan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p438" begin="18214870000t" end="18224460000t" region="bottomCenter">(KUDA MENGERANG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p439" begin="18224460000t" end="18236970000t" region="bottomCenter">Wah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p440" begin="18298690000t" end="18314970000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya akan<ns0:br />perbetulkan, Zaya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p441" begin="18740800000t" end="18761240000t" region="bottomCenter">mana-mana jemaah lagi.<ns0:br />HORUS: Saya tidak perlu</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p442" begin="18777510000t" end="18799190000t" region="bottomCenter">Penghormatan yang<ns0:br />busuk dan busuk.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p443" begin="18812130000t" end="18837570000t" region="bottomCenter">Melainkan anda membawa<ns0:br />lebih banyak wain, keluar.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p444" begin="18847170000t" end="18859250000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya bukan<ns0:br />ahli ibadah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p445" begin="18869260000t" end="18888870000t" region="bottomCenter">awak ni apa?<ns0:br />Pencuri?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p446" begin="18899290000t" end="18918490000t" region="bottomCenter">ya. Seorang<ns0:br />pencuri.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p447" begin="18933080000t" end="18949340000t" region="bottomCenter">Set mengambil daripada<ns0:br />anda. Saya ada sesuatu</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p448" begin="18961020000t" end="18978130000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p449" begin="19049440000t" end="19069880000t" region="bottomCenter">Tiada manusia yang boleh<ns0:br />merompak bilik kebal Set.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p450" begin="19084070000t" end="19107430000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda merompak salah seorang<ns0:br />mayat pengikut saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p451" begin="19107430000t" end="19119100000t" region="bottomCenter">Mereka tidak<ns0:br />pernah rapat pun.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p452" begin="19126610000t" end="19139120000t" region="bottomCenter">Berikan mereka<ns0:br />kepada saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p453" begin="19141620000t" end="19154550000t" region="bottomCenter">belum lagi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p454" begin="19154550000t" end="19169560000t" region="bottomCenter">Berikan saya<ns0:br />mata saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p455" begin="19169560000t" end="19185420000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya ada<ns0:br />cadangan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p456" begin="19185420000t" end="19199180000t" region="bottomCenter">Awak tawar-menawar<ns0:br />dengan saya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p457" begin="19209600000t" end="19222950000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p458" begin="19288860000t" end="19306370000t" region="bottomCenter">saya sanggup.<ns0:br />awak bertuah</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p459" begin="19306370000t" end="19319710000t" region="bottomCenter">seekor gajah berkaki tiga.<ns0:br />Anda tidak boleh menyerang</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p460" begin="19333480000t" end="19358090000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda mahukan ganjaran,<ns0:br />saya rasa? emas?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p461" begin="19358090000t" end="19371850000t" region="bottomCenter">Emas saya boleh<ns0:br />curi. (Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p462" begin="19539930000t" end="19554120000t" region="bottomCenter">(BERKEPEK) (HELUH)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p463" begin="19585820000t" end="19598750000t" region="bottomCenter">Ada seseorang yang<ns0:br />saya mahu selamatkan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p464" begin="19632110000t" end="19646710000t" region="bottomCenter">Dari apa?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p465" begin="19658390000t" end="19670480000t" region="bottomCenter">Kematian.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p466" begin="19670480000t" end="19690920000t" region="bottomCenter">(SCOFFS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p467" begin="19690920000t" end="19703850000t" region="bottomCenter">Bukankah ayahmu mengajar bahawa<ns0:br />kematian bukanlah penamat?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p468" begin="19703850000t" end="19725120000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia tidak boleh<ns0:br />dilakukan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p469" begin="19725120000t" end="19750980000t" region="bottomCenter">Nah, fikirkan. Tuhan<ns0:br />Udara! awak Horus,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p470" begin="19750980000t" end="19773090000t" region="bottomCenter">Atau mungkin saya akan melemparkan<ns0:br />apa yang saya ada di Sungai Nil.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p471" begin="19773090000t" end="19787270000t" region="bottomCenter">Tunggu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p472" begin="19890280000t" end="19901130000t" region="bottomCenter">HORUS: Tetap<ns0:br />bersama yang hidup.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p473" begin="19910300000t" end="19924490000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetap bersama<ns0:br />yang hidup.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p474" begin="19937000000t" end="19949100000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetap bersama<ns0:br />yang hidup.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p475" begin="19987050000t" end="20010400000t" region="bottomCenter">di mana saya boleh menghubunginya. -Dia<ns0:br />sudah melampaui -Tetapi awak adalah tuhan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p476" begin="20010400000t" end="20029600000t" region="bottomCenter">1,000 tahun anda,<ns0:br />Tuhan boleh hidup</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p477" begin="20029600000t" end="20045030000t" region="bottomCenter">mengubati kematian.<ns0:br />tetapi kita tidak boleh</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p478" begin="20060450000t" end="20080470000t" region="bottomCenter">Sudah tiba masanya untuk<ns0:br />dia berjalan di laluan itu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p479" begin="20080470000t" end="20090480000t" region="bottomCenter">sesuatu yang boleh<ns0:br />anda lakukan. mesti ada</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p480" begin="20090480000t" end="20103000000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya telah melakukan<ns0:br />semua yang saya boleh.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p481" begin="20121350000t" end="20146380000t" region="bottomCenter">Oh, engkau<ns0:br />yang kekal,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p482" begin="20146380000t" end="20167650000t" region="bottomCenter">utuskan hambamu untuk membimbing<ns0:br />orang mati kepada kehidupan baru.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p483" begin="20227710000t" end="20245640000t" region="bottomCenter">Anubis, keluar.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p484" begin="20245640000t" end="20260240000t" region="bottomCenter">(ANGIN MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p485" begin="20381190000t" end="20398300000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda dibebaskan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p486" begin="20483800000t" end="20519670000t" region="bottomCenter">Pintu Bumi terbuka<ns0:br />untuk anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p487" begin="20519670000t" end="20540110000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda mesti memulakan<ns0:br />perjalanan anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p488" begin="20540110000t" end="20555120000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia mati<ns0:br />sebagai hamba.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p489" begin="20555120000t" end="20568050000t" region="bottomCenter">dia tidak akan<ns0:br />dibenarkan Tanpa harta,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p490" begin="20568050000t" end="20580560000t" region="bottomCenter">melalui<ns0:br />Pintu Akhir.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p491" begin="20585150000t" end="20601410000t" region="bottomCenter">Apa yang anda<ns0:br />tawarkan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p492" begin="20601410000t" end="20620600000t" region="bottomCenter">ke alam Akhirat. Dia<ns0:br />tidak boleh lulus</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p493" begin="20636030000t" end="20656890000t" region="bottomCenter">Untukmu,<ns0:br />Tuhan Anubis,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p494" begin="20656890000t" end="20677740000t" region="bottomCenter">yang berada di atas<ns0:br />gunungnya, Gabenor Busur,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p495" begin="20707770000t" end="20722370000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya hanya mempunyai<ns0:br />senyuman saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p496" begin="20733210000t" end="20748230000t" region="bottomCenter">Jadilah ia.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p497" begin="20782840000t" end="20800370000t" region="bottomCenter">BEK: Zaya!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p498" begin="20802030000t" end="20821210000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia akan!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p499" begin="20821210000t" end="20830810000t" region="bottomCenter">Orang mati tidak bercakap<ns0:br />dengan orang hidup.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p500" begin="20957610000t" end="20972620000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetap di<ns0:br />jalan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p501" begin="21080650000t" end="21093990000t" region="bottomCenter">HORUS: Sekarang berikan<ns0:br />mereka kepada saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p502" begin="21109840000t" end="21129450000t" region="bottomCenter">-Anda tidak melakukan<ns0:br />apa-apa! -Mata saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p503" begin="21129450000t" end="21151540000t" region="bottomCenter">Habiskan sisa hari anda dengan<ns0:br />mengembara tanpa penglihatan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p504" begin="21151540000t" end="21163640000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak mempunyai apa-apa untuk<ns0:br />kehilangan. Adakah anda faham?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p505" begin="21163640000t" end="21185330000t" region="bottomCenter">Berikan saya<ns0:br />mata saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p506" begin="21185330000t" end="21200350000t" region="bottomCenter">dia lagi atau saya akan mati mencuba. Saya<ns0:br />akan melakukan apa sahaja untuk melihat</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p507" begin="21215360000t" end="21232460000t" region="bottomCenter">Awak nak sembunyi dari saya?<ns0:br />Belajar kurang bercakap.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p508" begin="21265830000t" end="21280850000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)<ns0:br />Di sini.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p509" begin="21293770000t" end="21308370000t" region="bottomCenter">(TERGAS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p510" begin="21377610000t" end="21390540000t" region="bottomCenter">(Mengeluh)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p511" begin="21390540000t" end="21402210000t" region="bottomCenter">mana yang<ns0:br />lain?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p512" begin="21406390000t" end="21420990000t" region="bottomCenter">(GAGAP)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p513" begin="21426820000t" end="21442250000t" region="bottomCenter">mana yang<ns0:br />lain?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p514" begin="21442250000t" end="21461850000t" region="bottomCenter">Nah, saya tidak<ns0:br />pasti, tetapi saya...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p515" begin="21461850000t" end="21477710000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya akan memenggal<ns0:br />leher awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p516" begin="21477710000t" end="21494390000t" region="bottomCenter">(TERSEKIK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p517" begin="21494390000t" end="21516910000t" region="bottomCenter">Awak mesti benci Set atas apa<ns0:br />yang dia buat pada ayah awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p518" begin="21555700000t" end="21572380000t" region="bottomCenter">Piramid itu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p519" begin="21572380000t" end="21584900000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tahu cara masuk<ns0:br />ke piramid Set.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p520" begin="21597830000t" end="21611590000t" region="bottomCenter">Bagaimana?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p521" begin="21622010000t" end="21633280000t" region="bottomCenter">Bagaimana?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p522" begin="21644960000t" end="21659140000t" region="bottomCenter">Oh...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p523" begin="21666650000t" end="21683740000t" region="bottomCenter">(Tercungap-cungap)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p524" begin="21683740000t" end="21704600000t" region="bottomCenter">kuasanya terkunci, bukan? Ia<ns0:br />adalah tempat dia menyimpan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p525" begin="21704600000t" end="21730460000t" region="bottomCenter">Kalau saya boleh bawa awak<ns0:br />masuk, boleh awak bunuh dia?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p526" begin="21734630000t" end="21749230000t" region="bottomCenter">(TANAH BEK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p527" begin="21770090000t" end="21782170000t" region="bottomCenter">Bagaimana anda<ns0:br />akan melakukannya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p528" begin="21787180000t" end="21802610000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya melihat<ns0:br />rancangan itu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p529" begin="21802610000t" end="21819300000t" region="bottomCenter">Beritahu saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p530" begin="21819300000t" end="21828480000t" region="bottomCenter">-Saya akan tunjukkan<ns0:br />kepada anda. -Teruskan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p531" begin="21828480000t" end="21842230000t" region="bottomCenter">Kalau awak bawak<ns0:br />Zaya balik.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p532" begin="21879360000t" end="21892280000t" region="bottomCenter">Mungkin ada<ns0:br />caranya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p533" begin="21916060000t" end="21942330000t" region="bottomCenter">akhirat pernah masuk. HORUS:<ns0:br />Tiada siapa boleh pergi</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p534" begin="21942330000t" end="21954430000t" region="bottomCenter">melalui Nine Gates<ns0:br />Tetapi perjalanan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p535" begin="21954430000t" end="21967780000t" region="bottomCenter">akan mengambil masa beberapa<ns0:br />hari untuk disiapkan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p536" begin="21982370000t" end="22005320000t" region="bottomCenter">boleh buat Anubis berpatah<ns0:br />balik. Dan hanya Raja</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p537" begin="22020750000t" end="22052440000t" region="bottomCenter">dan mengambil kembali mahkota<ns0:br />Jika saya membunuh Set</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p538" begin="22052440000t" end="22071640000t" region="bottomCenter">sampai ke Gerbang Akhir,<ns0:br />di hadapan kekasihmu</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p539" begin="22082470000t" end="22097490000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya mungkin dapat<ns0:br />menyelamatkannya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p540" begin="22112500000t" end="22127940000t" region="bottomCenter">(GEMPAR)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p541" begin="22175070000t" end="22189670000t" region="bottomCenter">Cuba untuk<ns0:br />teruskan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p542" begin="22249310000t" end="22272660000t" region="bottomCenter">SET: Anjing berdarah<ns0:br />saya yang hebat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p543" begin="22272660000t" end="22293520000t" region="bottomCenter">(ASKAR BERSORAK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p544" begin="22293520000t" end="22332720000t" region="bottomCenter">Kamu adalah anak-anak<ns0:br />Mesir yang sejati.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p545" begin="22332720000t" end="22352330000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda adalah anak-anak<ns0:br />besi dan darah saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p546" begin="22369850000t" end="22386950000t" region="bottomCenter">Tiada ayah yang<ns0:br />lebih berbangga.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p547" begin="22407390000t" end="22423650000t" region="bottomCenter">telah tercekik lembing<ns0:br />kami. Dewa-dewa pemberontak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p548" begin="22437420000t" end="22462850000t" region="bottomCenter">Selebihnya telah berundur<ns0:br />ke kubu Nephthys</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p549" begin="22462850000t" end="22492880000t" region="bottomCenter">di mana mereka kini bersedia<ns0:br />untuk menghadapi kita.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p550" begin="22492880000t" end="22520000000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi anda, legion<ns0:br />saya di padang pasir,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p551" begin="22520000000t" end="22541690000t" region="bottomCenter">akan membawa<ns0:br />mereka perhitungan!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p552" begin="22541690000t" end="22553780000t" region="bottomCenter">(BERSORAK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p553" begin="22572960000t" end="22589650000t" region="bottomCenter">Jadi penuhi emas<ns0:br />anda! (Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p554" begin="22621770000t" end="22633860000t" region="bottomCenter">Dan jika kamu gugur<ns0:br />dalam peperangan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p555" begin="22633860000t" end="22653040000t" region="bottomCenter">dan mengembara ke<ns0:br />Sembilan Pintu,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p556" begin="22653040000t" end="22683070000t" region="bottomCenter">siapakah yang kamu<ns0:br />sembah! beritahu abang</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p557" begin="22683070000t" end="22707690000t" region="bottomCenter">UMUM: Set Bahagian!<ns0:br />Amarn! Ta! Rai!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p558" begin="22713100000t" end="22727290000t" region="bottomCenter">Jatuh!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p559" begin="22736050000t" end="22754400000t" region="bottomCenter">Perarakan<ns0:br />ke hadapan!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p560" begin="22857000000t" end="22871600000t" region="bottomCenter">(MNEVIS GROUND)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p561" begin="22871600000t" end="22883270000t" region="bottomCenter">Tuanku.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p562" begin="22908300000t" end="22930830000t" region="bottomCenter">Perbendaharaan diraja<ns0:br />anda telah dilanggar.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p563" begin="22951270000t" end="22973780000t" region="bottomCenter">SET: Urshu...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p564" begin="22973780000t" end="23002980000t" region="bottomCenter">Bukankah mata itu bertujuan untuk memikat<ns0:br />mereka yang setia kepada Horus sehingga mati?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p565" begin="23013400000t" end="23029260000t" region="bottomCenter">(MNEVIS merengus)<ns0:br />Ya, Tuhan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p566" begin="23029260000t" end="23048030000t" region="bottomCenter">Dan bukankah<ns0:br />perangkapmu...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p567" begin="23060120000t" end="23076800000t" region="bottomCenter">Apakah istilah<ns0:br />yang anda gunakan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p568" begin="23087230000t" end="23101830000t" region="bottomCenter">Kalis pencuri?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p569" begin="23108090000t" end="23123100000t" region="bottomCenter">Ya, Tuhan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p570" begin="23128520000t" end="23141870000t" region="bottomCenter">Bolehkah anda<ns0:br />mengambil jejak?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p571" begin="23141870000t" end="23155210000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya akan<ns0:br />cari dia.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p572" begin="23155210000t" end="23173980000t" region="bottomCenter">Dan carilah<ns0:br />mana-mana sekutunya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p573" begin="23173980000t" end="23196510000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk mencuri kembali<ns0:br />matanya. cukup cerdik</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p574" begin="23228620000t" end="23246970000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia adalah seorang<ns0:br />manusia, Tuhan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p575" begin="23267410000t" end="23277840000t" region="bottomCenter">Seorang fana?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p576" begin="23277840000t" end="23292860000t" region="bottomCenter">(TERKECIK gugup)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p577" begin="23353740000t" end="23366260000t" region="bottomCenter">Siapa dia?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p578" begin="23366260000t" end="23378360000t" region="bottomCenter">hambaNya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p579" begin="23378360000t" end="23398380000t" region="bottomCenter">Dalam pembelaan<ns0:br />saya, Tuhan...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p580" begin="23398380000t" end="23429660000t" region="bottomCenter">Percayalah, saya sangat<ns0:br />ingin tahu apa alasan anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p581" begin="23429660000t" end="23440090000t" region="bottomCenter">Tapi bukan<ns0:br />sekarang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p582" begin="23440090000t" end="23453430000t" region="bottomCenter">Ya, Tuhan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p583" begin="23493060000t" end="23509740000t" region="bottomCenter">Nah, nampaknya<ns0:br />anda tidak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p584" begin="23509740000t" end="23526840000t" region="bottomCenter">manusia yang paling<ns0:br />cerdik di Mesir.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p585" begin="23533920000t" end="23547270000t" region="bottomCenter">Pencuri<ns0:br />ini adalah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p586" begin="23574380000t" end="23594400000t" region="bottomCenter">BEK: Jadi apa<ns0:br />rancangan awak?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p587" begin="23594400000t" end="23612760000t" region="bottomCenter">Tuhan Gurun, HORUS:<ns0:br />Untuk membunuh</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p588" begin="23612760000t" end="23626520000t" region="bottomCenter">padang pasir itu sendiri.<ns0:br />kita mesti membunuh</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p589" begin="23634020000t" end="23646960000t" region="bottomCenter">Bunuh padang<ns0:br />pasir?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p590" begin="23654460000t" end="23671570000t" region="bottomCenter">Bagaimana anda<ns0:br />membunuh padang pasir?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p591" begin="23734120000t" end="23754140000t" region="bottomCenter">kepada datuk saya.<ns0:br />Kita mesti pergi</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p592" begin="23754140000t" end="23767080000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia akan membantu kita<ns0:br />dengan tugas kita.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p593" begin="23767080000t" end="23784170000t" region="bottomCenter">datuk awak?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p594" begin="23784170000t" end="23798780000t" region="bottomCenter">Dewa Matahari Ra?<ns0:br />Anda maksudkan Ra?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p595" begin="23816710000t" end="23833400000t" region="bottomCenter">adakah datuk anda?<ns0:br />Jadi di mana sebenarnya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p596" begin="23872600000t" end="23892620000t" region="bottomCenter">Awak<ns0:br />kelakar kan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p597" begin="23892620000t" end="23907220000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda fikir saya akan berusaha<ns0:br />untuk menghiburkan anda?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p598" begin="23918480000t" end="23939330000t" region="bottomCenter">akan berguna sekarang.<ns0:br />Nampaknya terbang</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p599" begin="23939330000t" end="23963110000t" region="bottomCenter">Tanpa kedua-dua mata saya,<ns0:br />saya tidak boleh berubah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p600" begin="23963110000t" end="23975620000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya perlu berdoa<ns0:br />untuk kekuatan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p601" begin="23983130000t" end="23999390000t" region="bottomCenter">Oh, itu tidak<ns0:br />menggalakkan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p602" begin="23999390000t" end="24017330000t" region="bottomCenter">dasar gunung ini Senyap<ns0:br />atau anda akan sampai</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p603" begin="24017330000t" end="24034010000t" region="bottomCenter">daripada anda mencapai<ns0:br />puncak. lebih cepat</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p604" begin="24044430000t" end="24056950000t" region="bottomCenter">(ANGIN MENGERUNG)<ns0:br />(TERGAS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p605" begin="24220870000t" end="24250060000t" region="bottomCenter">Ra hebat, tahu<ns0:br />nama saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p606" begin="24264650000t" end="24278000000t" region="bottomCenter">Lord of the Air<ns0:br />mencari pelukan anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p607" begin="24345570000t" end="24371430000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya perlukan bantuan awak.<ns0:br />Tolonglah! (BISIK) Datuk,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p608" begin="24525750000t" end="24539930000t" region="bottomCenter">kagum!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p609" begin="24544930000t" end="24562040000t" region="bottomCenter">(KETAWA)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p610" begin="24795180000t" end="24808530000t" region="bottomCenter">(TANAH BEK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p611" begin="24873190000t" end="24884860000t" region="bottomCenter">HORUS: Tetap dalam<ns0:br />bayang-bayang saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p612" begin="24892370000t" end="24910300000t" region="bottomCenter">-Lakukan sahaja seperti<ns0:br />yang saya katakan. -Kenapa?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p613" begin="24910300000t" end="24922400000t" region="bottomCenter">(KULIT SAKIT)<ns0:br />(MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p614" begin="24939080000t" end="24954930000t" region="bottomCenter">HORUS: Salam,<ns0:br />Tuhan Ra.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p615" begin="24968280000t" end="24994560000t" region="bottomCenter">Biasanya, apabila seekor burung<ns0:br />mendarat di atas bot saya,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p616" begin="24994560000t" end="25007900000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya membunuhnya<ns0:br />sebelum ia boleh najis.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p617" begin="25029590000t" end="25045850000t" region="bottomCenter">Apakah ini?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p618" begin="25045850000t" end="25069210000t" region="bottomCenter">kepada sumber Penciptaan? Anda<ns0:br />berani membawa seorang fana</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p619" begin="25069210000t" end="25094660000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak dapat meninggalkannya.<ns0:br />Dia berharga bagi saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p620" begin="25094660000t" end="25127180000t" region="bottomCenter">Kenapa awak<ns0:br />datang? Ah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p621" begin="25127180000t" end="25144290000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya hanya akan meminta<ns0:br />sesuatu daripada anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p622" begin="25144290000t" end="25161390000t" region="bottomCenter">Oh, dalam<ns0:br />kes itu,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p623" begin="25161390000t" end="25196420000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya akan menghentikan apa yang saya<ns0:br />lakukan dan mematuhi arahan anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p624" begin="25196420000t" end="25214360000t" region="bottomCenter">Atuk, saya minta maaf. Maksud<ns0:br />saya tiada rasa tidak hormat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p625" begin="25214360000t" end="25233960000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda tidak tahu<ns0:br />perbezaannya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p626" begin="25233960000t" end="25246890000t" region="bottomCenter">(MERANGKANG<ns0:br />DALAM JAUH)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p627" begin="25287760000t" end="25306530000t" region="bottomCenter">Tinggal di<ns0:br />sana. Diamlah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p628" begin="25325710000t" end="25343240000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya ada kerja<ns0:br />nak buat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p629" begin="25372020000t" end="25385360000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus perlahan)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p630" begin="25528840000t" end="25546770000t" region="bottomCenter">Dan letakkan manusia di bawah<ns0:br />dek jika anda mahu dia hidup.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p631" begin="25765330000t" end="25777000000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p632" begin="25963020000t" end="25976780000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERAM)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p633" begin="26053110000t" end="26068960000t" region="bottomCenter">(APOPHIS MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p634" begin="26090230000t" end="26104000000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p635" begin="26356740000t" end="26388030000t" region="bottomCenter">Merangkak kembali ke<ns0:br />bayangan, wahai cacing busuk!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p636" begin="26403460000t" end="26434330000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda tidak akan pernah<ns0:br />menikmati ciptaan saya!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p637" begin="26452680000t" end="26471450000t" region="bottomCenter">Cuba seboleh<ns0:br />mungkin.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p638" begin="26507730000t" end="26527330000t" region="bottomCenter">Perkara akan berbeza<ns0:br />jika saya boleh tinggal</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p639" begin="26527330000t" end="26554870000t" region="bottomCenter">di taman Sungai Nil.<ns0:br />antara anak-anak saya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p640" begin="26554870000t" end="26582810000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk melawan syaitan Apophis<ns0:br />Ini adalah beban saya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p641" begin="26582810000t" end="26597820000t" region="bottomCenter">malam demi<ns0:br />malam.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p642" begin="26597820000t" end="26616590000t" region="bottomCenter">Mesir tidak boleh<ns0:br />dimusnahkan oleh Chaos.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p643" begin="26626190000t" end="26644960000t" region="bottomCenter">Jadi, anda<ns0:br />lihat,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p644" begin="26644960000t" end="26666640000t" region="bottomCenter">ada perkara yang lebih<ns0:br />teruk daripada Set.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p645" begin="26677060000t" end="26691670000t" region="bottomCenter">Awak silap.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p646" begin="26691670000t" end="26712940000t" region="bottomCenter">Iblis itu bukan yang<ns0:br />membunuh ayah saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p647" begin="26712940000t" end="26724200000t" region="bottomCenter">Membunuh<ns0:br />anak anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p648" begin="26724200000t" end="26750890000t" region="bottomCenter">Mereka berdua<ns0:br />anak lelaki saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p649" begin="26750890000t" end="26767150000t" region="bottomCenter">Mereka berdua sama<ns0:br />rata di mata saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p650" begin="26767150000t" end="26785100000t" region="bottomCenter">Seperti semua<ns0:br />ciptaan saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p651" begin="26785100000t" end="26809700000t" region="bottomCenter">takdirnya adalah kehendak<ns0:br />saya. Dan ketidakpastian</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p652" begin="26820130000t" end="26835560000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p653" begin="26887690000t" end="26917300000t" region="bottomCenter">Jadi apa sebenarnya yang<ns0:br />membawa anda ke sini?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p654" begin="26929400000t" end="26949420000t" region="bottomCenter">Izinkan saya mengisi kelalang<ns0:br />saya dengan air ini.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p655" begin="26993640000t" end="27006970000t" region="bottomCenter">Air itu bukan<ns0:br />milik saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p656" begin="27277660000t" end="27295190000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda merancang untuk<ns0:br />memadamkan api padang pasir.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p657" begin="27314790000t" end="27331890000t" region="bottomCenter">Untuk menjadi Raja<ns0:br />Untuk membunuh Set.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p658" begin="27331890000t" end="27348150000t" region="bottomCenter">seperti yang ayah<ns0:br />kamu kehendaki.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p659" begin="27348150000t" end="27364420000t" region="bottomCenter">Berikan saya kuasa<ns0:br />untuk terbang semula.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p660" begin="27364420000t" end="27387770000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya mendengar doa<ns0:br />anda kali pertama.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p661" begin="27387770000t" end="27399870000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya benarkan awak<ns0:br />datang ke sini</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p662" begin="27399870000t" end="27412800000t" region="bottomCenter">dan saya memberi<ns0:br />anda laluan pulang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p663" begin="27412800000t" end="27435750000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi<ns0:br />selepas itu?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p664" begin="27435750000t" end="27458260000t" region="bottomCenter">Tanpa kedua-dua<ns0:br />mataku,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p665" begin="27458260000t" end="27476620000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya ragu saya cukup kuat<ns0:br />untuk mengalahkan Set.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p666" begin="27476620000t" end="27488290000t" region="bottomCenter">Jadi menjadi<ns0:br />lebih kuat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p667" begin="27498300000t" end="27522910000t" region="bottomCenter">jadi malas sekian<ns0:br />lama Adakah anda telah</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p668" begin="27522910000t" end="27552110000t" region="bottomCenter">bahawa anda telah lupa setiap<ns0:br />kehidupan tuhan adalah perjalanan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p669" begin="27552110000t" end="27587970000t" region="bottomCenter">Apabila anda menyimpang dari<ns0:br />jalan anda, anda menjadi lemah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p670" begin="27587970000t" end="27600070000t" region="bottomCenter">(BERDEBAR)<ns0:br />BEK: Hei!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p671" begin="27610080000t" end="27640110000t" region="bottomCenter">menyelubungi manusia<ns0:br />ini? kenapa awak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p672" begin="27640110000t" end="27657620000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia mempunyai hempedu untuk<ns0:br />membuat tawar-menawar dengan saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p673" begin="27663890000t" end="27682660000t" region="bottomCenter">Ah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p674" begin="27682660000t" end="27709760000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak berbaloi dengan<ns0:br />papirus yang ditulis, hmm?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p675" begin="27709760000t" end="27735210000t" region="bottomCenter">(Mengeluh) Apa yang penting?<ns0:br />Dia hanyalah seorang fana.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p676" begin="27834060000t" end="27862420000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak meluluskan<ns0:br />cara Tetapkan peraturan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p677" begin="27862420000t" end="27885780000t" region="bottomCenter">anda akan menjadi lebih<ns0:br />baik. Tetapi saya tidak pasti</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p678" begin="28023000000t" end="28048430000t" region="bottomCenter">yang terakhir dari tuhan<ns0:br />pemberontak UMUM: Tuhan,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p679" begin="28048430000t" end="28061780000t" region="bottomCenter">di sebalik dindingnya.<ns0:br />telah berundur</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p680" begin="28073050000t" end="28088050000t" region="bottomCenter">Setiap yang<ns0:br />terakhir?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p681" begin="28090980000t" end="28108910000t" region="bottomCenter">Ya, tuan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p682" begin="28108910000t" end="28129770000t" region="bottomCenter">bagus. Kemudian mereka<ns0:br />sudah masak untuk dipetik.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p683" begin="28152290000t" end="28165640000t" region="bottomCenter">agak berlebihan?<ns0:br />bukankah ini</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p684" begin="28172730000t" end="28191910000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia mahu mereka<ns0:br />bertarung bermati-matian.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p685" begin="28204430000t" end="28220690000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia isteri<ns0:br />awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p686" begin="28220690000t" end="28237380000t" region="bottomCenter">Lebih-lebih lagi alasan<ns0:br />untuk membunuhnya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p687" begin="28251140000t" end="28267410000t" region="bottomCenter">Mulai sekarang,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p688" begin="28267410000t" end="28281170000t" region="bottomCenter">cara sesuatu.<ns0:br />ini akan menjadi</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p689" begin="28288670000t" end="28308690000t" region="bottomCenter">cara kita.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p690" begin="28308690000t" end="28323710000t" region="bottomCenter">Lebih baik biasakan diri.<ns0:br />(Hembus MELALUI GIGI)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p691" begin="28367930000t" end="28383360000t" region="bottomCenter">(ASKAR MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p692" begin="28598980000t" end="28618580000t" region="bottomCenter">(KEDUA-DUA MENDERENG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p693" begin="28708270000t" end="28721610000t" region="bottomCenter">(ASKAR-ASKAR MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p694" begin="28905960000t" end="28937660000t" region="bottomCenter">Adakah betul bahawa seorang dewi<ns0:br />harus melakukan kerja sedemikian?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p695" begin="28946420000t" end="28962270000t" region="bottomCenter">Sejak kamu<ns0:br />menjadi Raja,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p696" begin="28962270000t" end="28989370000t" region="bottomCenter">keperluan untuk kain kafan<ns0:br />pengebumian sangat besar.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p697" begin="29009390000t" end="29031500000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda boleh menjadi<ns0:br />seorang ratu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p698" begin="29031500000t" end="29049850000t" region="bottomCenter">NEPHTHYS: Anda sepatutnya tahu<ns0:br />mengapa saya tidak boleh.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p699" begin="29061110000t" end="29074460000t" region="bottomCenter">SET: Kemudian, apabila saya meminta<ns0:br />awak untuk berkahwin dengan saya,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p700" begin="29094070000t" end="29109910000t" region="bottomCenter">kenapa awak<ns0:br />kata ya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p701" begin="29109910000t" end="29130350000t" region="bottomCenter">menunggang keluar dari padang<ns0:br />pasir. Saya ingat bila awak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p702" begin="29143280000t" end="29190410000t" region="bottomCenter">terburu-buru. Bergaduh.<ns0:br />sangat kacak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p703" begin="29190410000t" end="29215020000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya mengharungi angin yang menyengat<ns0:br />itu hanya untuk berada di sisi awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p704" begin="29227950000t" end="29241290000t" region="bottomCenter">perbuatan besar<ns0:br />Dan dibayangkan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p705" begin="29241290000t" end="29255060000t" region="bottomCenter">capai bersama.<ns0:br />kami akan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p706" begin="29258820000t" end="29272990000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia tidak semua<ns0:br />menyengat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p707" begin="29289670000t" end="29304690000t" region="bottomCenter">Beberapa bahagian<ns0:br />adalah manis.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p708" begin="29317630000t" end="29337650000t" region="bottomCenter">NEPHTHYS: Mungkin.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p709" begin="29337650000t" end="29358500000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya masih fikir<ns0:br />kita boleh gembira.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p710" begin="29369750000t" end="29389770000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya sepatutnya sudah<ns0:br />cukup untuk memenuhi anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p711" begin="29389770000t" end="29402290000t" region="bottomCenter">(ELUPAS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p712" begin="29425650000t" end="29444000000t" region="bottomCenter">Tiada apa yang<ns0:br />dapat memenuhi saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p713" begin="29479860000t" end="29499880000t" region="bottomCenter">Sebab itu<ns0:br />Ra bijak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p714" begin="29499880000t" end="29520740000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk memastikan anda<ns0:br />tidak akan mempunyai anak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p715" begin="29564540000t" end="29576630000t" region="bottomCenter">(NEPHTHYS MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p716" begin="29625010000t" end="29639200000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p717" begin="29668810000t" end="29680900000t" region="bottomCenter">(MERENGEK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p718" begin="29730110000t" end="29752640000t" region="bottomCenter">kenapa?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p719" begin="29752640000t" end="29779740000t" region="bottomCenter">sehingga terlambat. Tiada<ns0:br />siapa yang akan tahu,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p720" begin="29786010000t" end="29797270000t" region="bottomCenter">(NEPHTHYS MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p721" begin="29925310000t" end="29939900000t" region="bottomCenter">(BEK MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p722" begin="29955340000t" end="29970350000t" region="bottomCenter">(HORUS MENGANDUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p723" begin="29970350000t" end="29982870000t" region="bottomCenter">(KEDUA-DUA MENGERENG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p724" begin="30010390000t" end="30027500000t" region="bottomCenter">(MELUDAH)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p725" begin="30027500000t" end="30042510000t" region="bottomCenter">Mungkin lain kali,<ns0:br />terus terbang</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p726" begin="30042510000t" end="30057530000t" region="bottomCenter">sehingga kita benar-benar<ns0:br />berada di atas tanah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p727" begin="30057530000t" end="30083390000t" region="bottomCenter">Apa yang Ra beri,<ns0:br />dia ambil balik.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p728" begin="30083390000t" end="30102990000t" region="bottomCenter">(KEDUA-DUA MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p729" begin="30102990000t" end="30115500000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya fikir dia<ns0:br />membantu awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p730" begin="30115500000t" end="30128020000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya mendapat apa<ns0:br />yang saya perlukan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p731" begin="30141360000t" end="30173480000t" region="bottomCenter">tidak dapat memadamkan api<ns0:br />Set. Seluruh Sungai Nil</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p732" begin="30173480000t" end="30195580000t" region="bottomCenter">air Penciptaan boleh.<ns0:br />Tetapi beberapa titis dari</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p733" begin="30202670000t" end="30221020000t" region="bottomCenter">Bunuh padang<ns0:br />pasir.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p734" begin="30221020000t" end="30245220000t" region="bottomCenter">Set akan menjadi lemah.<ns0:br />Dengan apinya hilang,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p735" begin="30245220000t" end="30260640000t" region="bottomCenter">Terdedah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p736" begin="30260640000t" end="30270650000t" region="bottomCenter">Apa yang akan berlaku<ns0:br />jika saya minum itu?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p737" begin="30281500000t" end="30323210000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda akan segar semula.<ns0:br />Kemudian anda akan mati.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p738" begin="30323210000t" end="30352820000t" region="bottomCenter">Penciptaan akan membunuh.<ns0:br />Nampak tak betul air tu</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p739" begin="30352820000t" end="30374090000t" region="bottomCenter">Kerana membazir air saya.<ns0:br />Saya akan bunuh awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p740" begin="30399540000t" end="30419140000t" region="bottomCenter">Apa ini?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p741" begin="30419140000t" end="30437490000t" region="bottomCenter">Jadi anda tidak mempunyai sesuatu<ns0:br />untuk diminum untuk membawa saya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p742" begin="30437490000t" end="30448340000t" region="bottomCenter">berbekam di<ns0:br />tangan anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p743" begin="30455010000t" end="30474610000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya bukan<ns0:br />hamba awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p744" begin="30474610000t" end="30490870000t" region="bottomCenter">Ayah saya<ns0:br />mengajar saya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p745" begin="30490870000t" end="30509230000t" region="bottomCenter">tidak layak bagi tuhan<ns0:br />untuk memukul lelaki.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p746" begin="30509230000t" end="30525910000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia sepatutnya mengajar anda<ns0:br />untuk melepaskan diri anda</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p747" begin="30525910000t" end="30538010000t" region="bottomCenter">dan dapatkan<ns0:br />air sendiri.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p748" begin="30561780000t" end="30575960000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p749" begin="30588900000t" end="30600980000t" region="bottomCenter">Maaf, Ayah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p750" begin="30751130000t" end="30765740000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERAM)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p751" begin="30765740000t" end="30778670000t" region="bottomCenter">(BEK MENJERONG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p752" begin="30784920000t" end="30800760000t" region="bottomCenter">Ini menjadi tidak<ns0:br />boleh diterima.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p753" begin="30867920000t" end="30880840000t" region="bottomCenter">Di manakah terletaknya<ns0:br />Eye of Horus?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p754" begin="30884190000t" end="30901280000t" region="bottomCenter">Di belakang<ns0:br />anda,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p755" begin="30901280000t" end="30911290000t" region="bottomCenter">bersama kambing yang<ns0:br />anda simpan di sana.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p756" begin="30927150000t" end="30950910000t" region="bottomCenter">Di manakah terletaknya<ns0:br />Eye of Horus?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p757" begin="30961340000t" end="30973860000t" region="bottomCenter">Di sini.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p758" begin="30973860000t" end="30991370000t" region="bottomCenter">(SCOFFS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p759" begin="30991370000t" end="31007230000t" region="bottomCenter">MNEVIS: Saya fikir<ns0:br />awak sedang merangkak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p760" begin="31007230000t" end="31020980000t" region="bottomCenter">tidak kelihatan dalam<ns0:br />lumpur di suatu tempat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p761" begin="31031410000t" end="31044760000t" region="bottomCenter">Potong dia!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p762" begin="31051430000t" end="31063950000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p763" begin="31099820000t" end="31112750000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENJERENG) (MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p764" begin="31159880000t" end="31171550000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p765" begin="31171550000t" end="31186160000t" region="bottomCenter">MNEVIS: Lihat,<ns0:br />saudara-saudara?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p766" begin="31186160000t" end="31206590000t" region="bottomCenter">Tanpa mata<ns0:br />sebelahnya, dia lemah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p767" begin="31206590000t" end="31221180000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERAM) (MERENGUS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p768" begin="31297940000t" end="31310450000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERUNG) (MERENGANG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p769" begin="31557780000t" end="31571530000t" region="bottomCenter">(JERENG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p770" begin="31662040000t" end="31674560000t" region="bottomCenter">(BEK MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p771" begin="31702080000t" end="31721680000t" region="bottomCenter">Walaupun saya<ns0:br />buta, pekak,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p772" begin="31736290000t" end="31751310000t" region="bottomCenter">kehilangan<ns0:br />anggota badan...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p773" begin="31776750000t" end="31791350000t" region="bottomCenter">tiada jodoh bagi<ns0:br />saya. awak masih</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p774" begin="31855990000t" end="31879350000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak jatuh mati. Anda<ns0:br />akan gembira mengetahui</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p775" begin="31879350000t" end="31892270000t" region="bottomCenter">Puji Ra.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p776" begin="31892270000t" end="31907290000t" region="bottomCenter">Perjanjian itu tidak<ns0:br />dikira jika saya mati.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p777" begin="31907290000t" end="31920230000t" region="bottomCenter">adalah untuk Zaya<ns0:br />dan saya berdua</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p778" begin="31920230000t" end="31934400000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk berada di<ns0:br />sini, bersama-sama.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p779" begin="31934400000t" end="31951510000t" region="bottomCenter">Bernafas!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p780" begin="31954840000t" end="31969440000t" region="bottomCenter">Di belakang<ns0:br />awak!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p781" begin="32061200000t" end="32075380000t" region="bottomCenter">BEK: Horus!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p782" begin="32075380000t" end="32089560000t" region="bottomCenter">Horus!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p783" begin="32119170000t" end="32134600000t" region="bottomCenter">(BEK MENYERU)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p784" begin="32154620000t" end="32181740000t" region="bottomCenter">Oh, Ra, sayang Ra,<ns0:br />tolong, tolong kami!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p785" begin="32181740000t" end="32193410000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p786" begin="32198840000t" end="32212170000t" region="bottomCenter">Horus!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p787" begin="32224270000t" end="32239710000t" region="bottomCenter">Kita akan<ns0:br />mati!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p788" begin="32315620000t" end="32329800000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p789" begin="32369420000t" end="32385270000t" region="bottomCenter">(BERNAFAS BERAT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p790" begin="32407380000t" end="32419470000t" region="bottomCenter">HORUS:<ns0:br />Selepas awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p791" begin="32439080000t" end="32452410000t" region="bottomCenter">(KEDUA-DUA MENGERENG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p792" begin="32493290000t" end="32510400000t" region="bottomCenter">(SELUAR)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p793" begin="32532910000t" end="32542920000t" region="bottomCenter">anda boleh melakukan<ns0:br />ini? Adakah anda pasti</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p794" begin="32542920000t" end="32563360000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya telah menyelamatkan<ns0:br />awak, bukan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p795" begin="32563360000t" end="32588810000t" region="bottomCenter">awak berguna untuk saya. -Oh, awak<ns0:br />selamatkan saya? -Hanya kerana</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p796" begin="32588810000t" end="32602980000t" region="bottomCenter">apa yang berguna?<ns0:br />BEK: Awak tahu</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p797" begin="32602980000t" end="32623000000t" region="bottomCenter">Mata awak<ns0:br />yang lain.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p798" begin="32623000000t" end="32634680000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya boleh curi balik untuk<ns0:br />awak, kalau awak suka.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p799" begin="32634680000t" end="32652210000t" region="bottomCenter">kesabaran saya,<ns0:br />fana. Jangan uji</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p800" begin="32652210000t" end="32665130000t" region="bottomCenter">Nama saya<ns0:br />bukan "fana."</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p801" begin="32691830000t" end="32703920000t" region="bottomCenter">Apa itu,<ns0:br />kemudian?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p802" begin="32709760000t" end="32722680000t" region="bottomCenter">Pemain pertahanan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p803" begin="32726860000t" end="32747300000t" region="bottomCenter">Baiklah, Bek.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p804" begin="32747300000t" end="32763980000t" region="bottomCenter">Jalan raya akan<ns0:br />diperhatikan sekarang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p805" begin="32763980000t" end="32780250000t" region="bottomCenter">pemburu yang lebih baik.<ns0:br />Set akan menghantar</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p806" begin="32903280000t" end="32929980000t" region="bottomCenter">Nah, itu tidak mengikut<ns0:br />rancangan, bukan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p807" begin="32929980000t" end="32953330000t" region="bottomCenter">MNEVIS:<ns0:br />Tidak, Tuhan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p808" begin="32953330000t" end="32982540000t" region="bottomCenter">Anak saudara saya melakukan<ns0:br />semua ini dengan sebelah mata?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p809" begin="32982540000t" end="33003380000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya memandang<ns0:br />rendah kekuatannya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p810" begin="33003380000t" end="33015900000t" region="bottomCenter">Sukar untuk<ns0:br />membunuh, budak itu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p811" begin="33030080000t" end="33043420000t" region="bottomCenter">Macam<ns0:br />pakcik dia.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p812" begin="33053430000t" end="33079300000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia bersekutu dengan<ns0:br />siapa? Ke mana dia pergi?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p813" begin="33079300000t" end="33103480000t" region="bottomCenter">Satu-satunya sekutunya<ns0:br />adalah fana.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p814" begin="33103480000t" end="33119760000t" region="bottomCenter">tentera, adakah ia?<ns0:br />Ia hampir tidak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p815" begin="33119760000t" end="33131440000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya mendengar<ns0:br />mereka.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p816" begin="33131440000t" end="33143520000t" region="bottomCenter">Manusia itu bercakap<ns0:br />tentang tawar-menawar</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p817" begin="33143520000t" end="33156870000t" region="bottomCenter">dia buat<ns0:br />dengan Horus.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p818" begin="33162720000t" end="33186070000t" region="bottomCenter">manusia yang bercita-cita<ns0:br />tinggi. Ini adalah satu</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p819" begin="33186070000t" end="33205670000t" region="bottomCenter">Horus telah<ns0:br />bersetuju</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p820" begin="33205670000t" end="33222780000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk membawa wanita fana<ns0:br />itu kembali dari kematian.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p821" begin="33236540000t" end="33251970000t" region="bottomCenter">Adakah<ns0:br />anda pasti?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p822" begin="33251970000t" end="33270740000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya yakin<ns0:br />itu, Tuhan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p823" begin="33270740000t" end="33283240000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p824" begin="33313690000t" end="33332890000t" region="bottomCenter">dapatkan yang dilayani.<ns0:br />Anda sepatutnya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p825" begin="33332890000t" end="33356660000t" region="bottomCenter">-Ya, Tuhan. terima<ns0:br />kasih. -Kerja yang bagus.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p826" begin="33377930000t" end="33391280000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p827" begin="33426310000t" end="33453830000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda sepatutnya mempercayai kami<ns0:br />dengan perkara ini dari awal.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p828" begin="33453830000t" end="33468850000t" region="bottomCenter">meninggalkan anda berpuas<ns0:br />hati? Bukankah kita selalu</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p829" begin="33499720000t" end="33518900000t" region="bottomCenter">Lepas tu puaskan<ns0:br />aku lagi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p830" begin="33582300000t" end="33594810000t" region="bottomCenter">Adakah anda membiarkan<ns0:br />isteri anda hidup?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p831" begin="33634010000t" end="33660710000t" region="bottomCenter">anda dan saya akan<ns0:br />berakhir lambat laun,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p832" begin="33660710000t" end="33673630000t" region="bottomCenter">sama sahaja.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p833" begin="33794170000t" end="33816280000t" region="bottomCenter">Tanah Orang Mati dan<ns0:br />Sembilan Pintunya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p834" begin="33828380000t" end="33858830000t" region="bottomCenter">Puan Barat?<ns0:br />Adakah ia tepat,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p835" begin="33858830000t" end="33874250000t" region="bottomCenter">Jangan panggil<ns0:br />saya begitu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p836" begin="33874250000t" end="33894270000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tinggalkan<ns0:br />semua itu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p837" begin="33894270000t" end="33918470000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak lama lagi, saya akan<ns0:br />memerintah seluruh dunia.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p838" begin="33918470000t" end="33944320000t" region="bottomCenter">Tanah Orang Mati adalah<ns0:br />kerajaan terakhir</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p839" begin="33944320000t" end="33958930000t" region="bottomCenter">dibiarkan berdiri.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p840" begin="33958930000t" end="33973930000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda mahukan perkara yang<ns0:br />anda tidak boleh miliki.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p841" begin="33998550000t" end="34012320000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk membawa saya ke<ns0:br />sana. saya nak awak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p842" begin="34012320000t" end="34027330000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi anda adalah<ns0:br />jiwa yang hidup.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p843" begin="34027330000t" end="34046510000t" region="bottomCenter">jiwa yang hidup, juga,<ns0:br />Ya. Dan anda pernah</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p844" begin="34046510000t" end="34065280000t" region="bottomCenter">semasa anda menjadi<ns0:br />penasihat kepada orang mati.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p845" begin="34065280000t" end="34081970000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda tahu apa yang menunggu<ns0:br />saya jika saya kembali.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p846" begin="34091140000t" end="34105320000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda mempunyai<ns0:br />gelang kecil anda</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p847" begin="34105320000t" end="34128260000t" region="bottomCenter">daripada syaitan itu.<ns0:br />untuk melindungi anda</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p848" begin="34128260000t" end="34141190000t" region="bottomCenter">Bukan itu<ns0:br />sahaja.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p849" begin="34148280000t" end="34174130000t" region="bottomCenter">(BERBISIK) Awak<ns0:br />rindu. bukan awak?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p850" begin="34186230000t" end="34212100000t" region="bottomCenter">Apa yang dibawa keluar<ns0:br />dalam diri anda. Kegelapan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p851" begin="34217100000t" end="34234610000t" region="bottomCenter">(BISIK) Tidak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p852" begin="34234610000t" end="34264220000t" region="bottomCenter">Ah, awak tidak begitu<ns0:br />baik, Dewi Cinta.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p853" begin="34276740000t" end="34289260000t" region="bottomCenter">saya tahu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p854" begin="34289260000t" end="34307610000t" region="bottomCenter">Kemudian<ns0:br />lakukan ini.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p855" begin="34307610000t" end="34344300000t" region="bottomCenter">Kemudian kita boleh memiliki segala-galanya.<ns0:br />Buktikan kesetiaan awak kepada saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p856" begin="34356400000t" end="34373930000t" region="bottomCenter">bersama-sama.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p857" begin="34451090000t" end="34463180000t" region="bottomCenter">(LEMBUT) Horus...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p858" begin="34476520000t" end="34493630000t" region="bottomCenter">sayang saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p859" begin="34552860000t" end="34564940000t" region="bottomCenter">HATHOR: Horus...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p860" begin="34626670000t" end="34644610000t" region="bottomCenter">di kubur ayah<ns0:br />kamu? awak bukan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p861" begin="34681730000t" end="34694660000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tertanya-tanya di<ns0:br />mana dia berada. (TERGAS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p862" begin="34711760000t" end="34724690000t" region="bottomCenter">Sekarang<ns0:br />saya tahu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p863" begin="34730950000t" end="34744300000t" region="bottomCenter">Terima kasih.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p864" begin="34765140000t" end="34789340000t" region="bottomCenter">Bagi seseorang yang<ns0:br />melenturkan kehendak lelaki</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p865" begin="34789340000t" end="34804360000t" region="bottomCenter">dengan memukul<ns0:br />sebatannya,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p866" begin="34811860000t" end="34824380000t" region="bottomCenter">awak bukan<ns0:br />pandai sangat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p867" begin="34844400000t" end="34857320000t" region="bottomCenter">Berapa lama dia<ns0:br />mempunyai penglihatannya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p868" begin="34857320000t" end="34869420000t" region="bottomCenter">Kenapa awak<ns0:br />peduli?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p869" begin="34869420000t" end="34883600000t" region="bottomCenter">(SCOFFS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p870" begin="34897780000t" end="34914880000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya milik<ns0:br />awak sekarang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p871" begin="34919890000t" end="34934900000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya akan lakukan<ns0:br />seperti yang anda minta.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p872" begin="34945320000t" end="34959510000t" region="bottomCenter">Walaupun saya<ns0:br />membunuh Horus?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p873" begin="34975350000t" end="34987870000t" region="bottomCenter">(BERBISIK)<ns0:br />Sudah tentu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p874" begin="34995370000t" end="35012900000t" region="bottomCenter">Siapa yang mengambil<ns0:br />berat tentang dia?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p875" begin="35043760000t" end="35055430000t" region="bottomCenter">anda akan keletihan<ns0:br />saya fikir</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p876" begin="35055430000t" end="35068370000t" region="bottomCenter">dari banyak<ns0:br />pembohongan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p877" begin="35169720000t" end="35204760000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya suka Nephthys sekali<ns0:br />dan saya mengambil sayapnya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p878" begin="35215590000t" end="35228940000t" region="bottomCenter">Bayangkan apa yang saya<ns0:br />akan lakukan kepada anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p879" begin="35256050000t" end="35273160000t" region="bottomCenter">Lakukan itu dan saya<ns0:br />akan memburu awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p880" begin="35292340000t" end="35304860000t" region="bottomCenter">(SET GRUNTS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p881" begin="35304860000t" end="35316950000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p882" begin="35360330000t" end="35374090000t" region="bottomCenter">(HATHOR merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p883" begin="35374090000t" end="35385350000t" region="bottomCenter">SYAITAN PEREMPUAN:<ns0:br />Biar saya sentuh.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p884" begin="35395770000t" end="35414550000t" region="bottomCenter">(SYITAN KETAWA)<ns0:br />(HATHOR MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p885" begin="35497960000t" end="35514650000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p886" begin="35514650000t" end="35528830000t" region="bottomCenter">(BERNAFAS BERAT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p887" begin="35528830000t" end="35545920000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya rasa ia lebih<ns0:br />baik daripada berlari.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p888" begin="35553020000t" end="35572620000t" region="bottomCenter">(TERHANGAT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p889" begin="35646020000t" end="35665630000t" region="bottomCenter">(MERENGANG LEMBUT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p890" begin="35734870000t" end="35747380000t" region="bottomCenter">(BEK merengus<ns0:br />perlahan)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p891" begin="35870840000t" end="35895450000t" region="bottomCenter">tapak perkhemahan lain kali? yang<ns0:br />kurang menyenangkan Bolehkah kita dapati</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p892" begin="35906700000t" end="35923810000t" region="bottomCenter">Hmm.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p893" begin="35937980000t" end="35959260000t" region="bottomCenter">Ini pernah menjadi taman seperti<ns0:br />yang anda tidak pernah lihat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p894" begin="36134850000t" end="36146110000t" region="bottomCenter">Apa yang<ns0:br />berlaku?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p895" begin="36156530000t" end="36183650000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia adalah kuil<ns0:br />pertama ayah saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p896" begin="36183650000t" end="36201170000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia membuka alasan<ns0:br />Dalam kemurahan hatinya,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p897" begin="36201170000t" end="36216180000t" region="bottomCenter">supaya orang miskin boleh<ns0:br />menanam sendiri di sini.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p898" begin="36236610000t" end="36253300000t" region="bottomCenter">Set telah merosakkan<ns0:br />ajarannya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p899" begin="36285840000t" end="36301270000t" region="bottomCenter">suka tempat<ns0:br />ini. ayah saya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p900" begin="36317530000t" end="36337550000t" region="bottomCenter">Jadi Set membawanya ke<ns0:br />sini untuk disembelih.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p901" begin="36366740000t" end="36393860000t" region="bottomCenter">Tubuhnya dipotong<ns0:br />menjadi 14 bahagian.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p902" begin="36393860000t" end="36408450000t" region="bottomCenter">Hati tidak<ns0:br />pernah ditemui.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p903" begin="36408450000t" end="36425560000t" region="bottomCenter">Set masin<ns0:br />bumi?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p904" begin="36425560000t" end="36451000000t" region="bottomCenter">air mata ibu<ns0:br />saya. Tidak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p905" begin="36465180000t" end="36480190000t" region="bottomCenter">Sebelum dia mengambil<ns0:br />nyawanya sendiri.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p906" begin="36506060000t" end="36518150000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya gagalkan<ns0:br />mereka.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p907" begin="36537330000t" end="36553600000t" region="bottomCenter">saya minta<ns0:br />maaf.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p908" begin="36553600000t" end="36577790000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya sedang dalam perjalanan.<ns0:br />Ra memberitahu saya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p909" begin="36596150000t" end="36632010000t" region="bottomCenter">Dan jika saya sampai ke penghujungnya,<ns0:br />saya akan menjadi perkasa lagi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p910" begin="36647020000t" end="36661630000t" region="bottomCenter">Bagaimana<ns0:br />ia berakhir?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p911" begin="36661630000t" end="36676230000t" region="bottomCenter">Dengan dendam.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p912" begin="36697910000t" end="36716680000t" region="bottomCenter">melalui tengkorak Set.<ns0:br />Berakhir dengan lembing saya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p913" begin="36733780000t" end="36750880000t" region="bottomCenter">(GEMPAR<ns0:br />DALAM JAUH)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p914" begin="36750880000t" end="36765480000t" region="bottomCenter">Adakah<ns0:br />itu ribut?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p915" begin="36776330000t" end="36789250000t" region="bottomCenter">Tiada awan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p916" begin="36798840000t" end="36826380000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERAM)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p917" begin="36826380000t" end="36840550000t" region="bottomCenter">menunggang haiwan peliharaan<ns0:br />mereka. Pemburu set</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p918" begin="36857230000t" end="36887260000t" region="bottomCenter">Itu bukan haiwan peliharaan.<ns0:br />Kucing adalah haiwan peliharaan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p919" begin="36887260000t" end="36907700000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak boleh menahan Tidak<ns0:br />seperti saya sekarang. racun mereka.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p920" begin="36907700000t" end="36927300000t" region="bottomCenter">kita patut lari.<ns0:br />Kemudian saya rasa</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p921" begin="36927300000t" end="36946910000t" region="bottomCenter">Manusia melakukannya<ns0:br />sepanjang masa! lari?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p922" begin="37011560000t" end="37026160000t" region="bottomCenter">(TOOTING)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p923" begin="37111240000t" end="37125430000t" region="bottomCenter">Lari lebih<ns0:br />cepat!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p924" begin="37125430000t" end="37137100000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak<ns0:br />boleh!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p925" begin="37145860000t" end="37157120000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p926" begin="37162130000t" end="37181730000t" region="bottomCenter">(MERENGANG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p927" begin="37181730000t" end="37193410000t" region="bottomCenter">Lari lebih<ns0:br />cepat!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p928" begin="37193410000t" end="37207170000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak<ns0:br />boleh!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p929" begin="37326460000t" end="37338550000t" region="bottomCenter">HORUS: Ayuh!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p930" begin="37346480000t" end="37358570000t" region="bottomCenter">(KEDUA-DUA MENGERENG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p931" begin="37452830000t" end="37472850000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk membunuh mereka.<ns0:br />-Kami ada -"Kami"?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p932" begin="37472850000t" end="37493710000t" region="bottomCenter">apa yang paling penting?<ns0:br />Apabila anda pergi memancing,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p933" begin="37493710000t" end="37512890000t" region="bottomCenter">-Ia adalah kualiti -Saya tidak<ns0:br />memancing. daripada umpan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p934" begin="37512890000t" end="37524990000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia terlalu<ns0:br />berbahaya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p935" begin="37524990000t" end="37546680000t" region="bottomCenter">Awak risaukan<ns0:br />saya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p936" begin="37546680000t" end="37567940000t" region="bottomCenter">tujuan saya dengan lembing bukanlah<ns0:br />seperti yang sebelumnya. Tidak, cuma</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p937" begin="37567940000t" end="37582130000t" region="bottomCenter">sebelum anda membuangnya.<ns0:br />Kemudian mendekatkan diri</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p938" begin="37670550000t" end="37686400000t" region="bottomCenter">Hei! Cantik!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p939" begin="37716430000t" end="37731860000t" region="bottomCenter">Maksud saya ular<ns0:br />itu! (Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p940" begin="37731860000t" end="37746460000t" region="bottomCenter">(MERENGANG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p941" begin="37784000000t" end="37797760000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p942" begin="37837390000t" end="37849480000t" region="bottomCenter">(JERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p943" begin="37934570000t" end="37947910000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p944" begin="38014650000t" end="38027990000t" region="bottomCenter">(ULAR MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p945" begin="38077210000t" end="38099310000t" region="bottomCenter">Itu berkesan.<ns0:br />Jom pergi lagi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p946" begin="38099310000t" end="38128500000t" region="bottomCenter">perlu berjuntai lebih<ns0:br />lama. Kali ini, umpan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p947" begin="38128500000t" end="38143110000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya mesti menyerang<ns0:br />tempat lemah dari belakang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p948" begin="38143110000t" end="38157290000t" region="bottomCenter">mereka mempunyai kelemahan?<ns0:br />Dan bagaimana anda tahu</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p949" begin="38157290000t" end="38171050000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi mereka mesti,<ns0:br />bukan? saya tidak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p950" begin="38171050000t" end="38186070000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengek) Pergi!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p951" begin="38205670000t" end="38218180000t" region="bottomCenter">(Meraung)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p952" begin="38242790000t" end="38257390000t" region="bottomCenter">(SERUAN ANAT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p953" begin="38310350000t" end="38327460000t" region="bottomCenter">(Meraung)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p954" begin="38381260000t" end="38395860000t" region="bottomCenter">(TANAH BEK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p955" begin="38438810000t" end="38456340000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda telah membuatnya<ns0:br />marah. Cemerlang!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p956" begin="38498870000t" end="38511390000t" region="bottomCenter">(SELUAR)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p957" begin="38530990000t" end="38543920000t" region="bottomCenter">(JERENG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p958" begin="38548100000t" end="38560190000t" region="bottomCenter">(TERHANGAT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p959" begin="38572700000t" end="38586470000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p960" begin="38618990000t" end="38636100000t" region="bottomCenter">Sayang sekali anda tidak boleh<ns0:br />terbang lagi. (Horus mengerang)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p961" begin="38642770000t" end="38657370000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p962" begin="38694910000t" end="38708670000t" region="bottomCenter">(BEK SERU)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p963" begin="38711170000t" end="38725770000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda juga<ns0:br />tidak boleh.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p964" begin="38771650000t" end="38786250000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p965" begin="38839210000t" end="38853400000t" region="bottomCenter">(TERUS MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p966" begin="38867170000t" end="38879250000t" region="bottomCenter">(BEK TERKECIK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p967" begin="39059850000t" end="39075710000t" region="bottomCenter">awak!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p968" begin="39081120000t" end="39100730000t" region="bottomCenter">dan menjauhi<ns0:br />saya. diam saja</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p969" begin="39133680000t" end="39149520000t" region="bottomCenter">(MERENGANG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p970" begin="39149520000t" end="39184980000t" region="bottomCenter">anda tidak termasuk dalam<ns0:br />pertempuran. gadis cantik,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p971" begin="39197910000t" end="39213340000t" region="bottomCenter">Bakar dia!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p972" begin="39213340000t" end="39227940000t" region="bottomCenter">(BERDESIK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p973" begin="39259630000t" end="39280910000t" region="bottomCenter">Alangkah indahnya<ns0:br />makhlukmu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p974" begin="39293420000t" end="39307190000t" region="bottomCenter">Biar saya<ns0:br />bantu awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p975" begin="39335550000t" end="39348060000t" region="bottomCenter">ASTARTE:<ns0:br />Bakar dia!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p976" begin="39356820000t" end="39384760000t" region="bottomCenter">Awak sangat<ns0:br />sejuk.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p977" begin="39399770000t" end="39436900000t" region="bottomCenter">Panaskan diri. saya<ns0:br />perintahkan awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p978" begin="39436900000t" end="39457760000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERAM)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p979" begin="39457760000t" end="39469840000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p980" begin="39521560000t" end="39538670000t" region="bottomCenter">dengan pantas.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p981" begin="39551590000t" end="39569120000t" region="bottomCenter">(MERENGANG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p982" begin="39577040000t" end="39589960000t" region="bottomCenter">(MULA MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p983" begin="39634600000t" end="39647110000t" region="bottomCenter">adalah lebih baik.<ns0:br />Syarikat anda</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p984" begin="39740110000t" end="39759310000t" region="bottomCenter">HORUS: Keterlaluan!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p985" begin="39759310000t" end="39775990000t" region="bottomCenter">HATHOR: Anda dialu-alukan<ns0:br />kerana menyelamatkan nyawa anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p986" begin="39775990000t" end="39790160000t" region="bottomCenter">Maka semasa aku duduk buta<ns0:br />di dalam kubur ayahku,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p987" begin="39790160000t" end="39800170000t" region="bottomCenter">katil dengan tuhan<ns0:br />yang anda kongsi</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p988" begin="39800170000t" end="39820190000t" region="bottomCenter">yang mencabut<ns0:br />mata saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p989" begin="39820190000t" end="39844810000t" region="bottomCenter">pada seseorang yang tidak dapat melihat?<ns0:br />Mengapa saya akan membazirkan ini</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p990" begin="39844810000t" end="39863160000t" region="bottomCenter">Kenapa saya<ns0:br />percaya awak lagi?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p991" begin="39863160000t" end="39889020000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia membunuh semua tuhan yang<ns0:br />tidak akan tunduk kepadanya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p992" begin="39889020000t" end="39910280000t" region="bottomCenter">Itu termasuk<ns0:br />saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p993" begin="39910280000t" end="39927390000t" region="bottomCenter">Kami menceroboh<ns0:br />kuil Set.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p994" begin="39927390000t" end="39940310000t" region="bottomCenter">Horus akan<ns0:br />membunuhnya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p995" begin="39940310000t" end="39954920000t" region="bottomCenter">merancang untuk<ns0:br />masuk? Apa khabar</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p996" begin="39963260000t" end="39980770000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p997" begin="39980770000t" end="40000370000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia telah melihat rancangan<ns0:br />itu. Dia tahu jalannya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p998" begin="40000370000t" end="40014140000t" region="bottomCenter">Adakah anda sudah lupa tentang<ns0:br />itu? Bagaimana dengan Sphinx?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p999" begin="40014140000t" end="40034160000t" region="bottomCenter">"Sphinx"?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1000" begin="40034160000t" end="40055430000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk menjaga apinya.<ns0:br />Set menangkapnya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1001" begin="40055430000t" end="40080450000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia akan membunuh tanpa belas<ns0:br />kasihan semua yang masuk</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1002" begin="40080450000t" end="40096730000t" region="bottomCenter">jawab teka-tekinya.<ns0:br />jika mereka tidak boleh</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1003" begin="40096730000t" end="40109240000t" region="bottomCenter">teka-teki, kan?<ns0:br />Anda boleh menjawab</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1004" begin="40109240000t" end="40123000000t" region="bottomCenter">Thoth untuk bantuan.<ns0:br />Kami akan bertanya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1005" begin="40130500000t" end="40152610000t" region="bottomCenter">(SCOFFS) Kenapa awak<ns0:br />sengaja buat macam tu?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1006" begin="40152610000t" end="40174720000t" region="bottomCenter">daripada yang sangat diperlukan. Jadi<ns0:br />kita tidak perlu mati lebih awal</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1007" begin="40174720000t" end="40189740000t" region="bottomCenter">jom pergi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1008" begin="40300670000t" end="40313610000t" region="bottomCenter">Adakah dia memberi<ns0:br />awak pakaian itu?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1009" begin="40334880000t" end="40354480000t" region="bottomCenter">apa yang disediakan.<ns0:br />Saya memilih daripada</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1010" begin="40354480000t" end="40367000000t" region="bottomCenter">yang anda fikir<ns0:br />Jadi anda pilih</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1011" begin="40367000000t" end="40382420000t" region="bottomCenter">akan paling<ns0:br />menggembirakannya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1012" begin="40382420000t" end="40400770000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya berpakaian untuk menggembirakan<ns0:br />diri sendiri. HORUS: Hmm.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1013" begin="40400770000t" end="40423720000t" region="bottomCenter">kenapa? Anda<ns0:br />tidak menyukainya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1014" begin="40423720000t" end="40440810000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia terlalu<ns0:br />banyak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1015" begin="40440810000t" end="40467100000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya adalah Dewi<ns0:br />Terlalu Banyak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1016" begin="40467100000t" end="40482940000t" region="bottomCenter">Dan ada banyak yang saya<ns0:br />telah berikan kepada anda</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1017" begin="40482940000t" end="40498380000t" region="bottomCenter">anda tidak pernah<ns0:br />mendapati berlebihan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1018" begin="40505880000t" end="40518820000t" region="bottomCenter">Ah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1019" begin="40518820000t" end="40539670000t" region="bottomCenter">Sekarang mungkin<ns0:br />terlalu sedikit.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1020" begin="40539670000t" end="40565110000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda tidak pernah begitu<ns0:br />sukar untuk menyenangkan hati.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1021" begin="40565110000t" end="40580130000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda melambatkan<ns0:br />kami.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1022" begin="40581370000t" end="40598480000t" region="bottomCenter">Ooh.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1023" begin="40620990000t" end="40643940000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya fikir ia membuatkan<ns0:br />anda kelihatan nakal.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1024" begin="40643940000t" end="40663120000t" region="bottomCenter">Apakah rupa saya<ns0:br />sebelum ini?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1025" begin="40663120000t" end="40678980000t" region="bottomCenter">-Tidak<ns0:br />sedar. -Oh!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1026" begin="40678980000t" end="40689820000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi dengan<ns0:br />cara yang comel.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1027" begin="40689820000t" end="40710260000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak<ns0:br />sedar apa?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1028" begin="40710260000t" end="40738200000t" region="bottomCenter">Tepat sekali. Awak selalu<ns0:br />menganggap saya remeh.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1029" begin="40738200000t" end="40755720000t" region="bottomCenter">apa?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1030" begin="40755720000t" end="40773650000t" region="bottomCenter">Dengan mata anda kembali, anda<ns0:br />sepatutnya datang untuk mendapatkan saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1031" begin="40773650000t" end="40790750000t" region="bottomCenter">-Tidakkah saya cukup<ns0:br />bermakna kepada anda? -Oh?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1032" begin="40814110000t" end="40828710000t" region="bottomCenter">(HATHOR MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1033" begin="40841210000t" end="40854150000t" region="bottomCenter">(TERGAS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1034" begin="40915040000t" end="40934230000t" region="bottomCenter">(KETAWA)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1035" begin="40934230000t" end="40957590000t" region="bottomCenter">Jadilah sayang dan<ns0:br />ambilkan saya air bersih.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1036" begin="40991360000t" end="41007640000t" region="bottomCenter">Adakah ia akan membunuh anda<ns0:br />untuk mengatakan "tolong"?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1037" begin="41007640000t" end="41037670000t" region="bottomCenter">dalam mood nak berdebat.<ns0:br />Saya benar-benar tidak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1038" begin="41037670000t" end="41079790000t" region="bottomCenter">Pergi ambil untuk saya.<ns0:br />saya perintahkan awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1039" begin="41101470000t" end="41113570000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda semua<ns0:br />sama, bukan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1040" begin="41128170000t" end="41141100000t" region="bottomCenter">siapa<ns0:br />nama dia?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1041" begin="41155700000t" end="41182390000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya boleh membuat mana-mana lelaki, wanita,<ns0:br />tuhan atau binatang melakukan perintah saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1042" begin="41182390000t" end="41202410000t" region="bottomCenter">Melainkan hati mereka<ns0:br />milik orang lain.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1043" begin="41215760000t" end="41230360000t" region="bottomCenter">awak sedang<ns0:br />jatuh cinta.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1044" begin="41251620000t" end="41276240000t" region="bottomCenter">Nama dia<ns0:br />Zaya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1045" begin="41316690000t" end="41332120000t" region="bottomCenter">saya minta<ns0:br />maaf sangat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1046" begin="41416790000t" end="41441810000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya berjanji kepadanya<ns0:br />rumah yang sesuai.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1047" begin="41441810000t" end="41461010000t" region="bottomCenter">Wang untuk keluarga.<ns0:br />Kehormatan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1048" begin="41461010000t" end="41482690000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak<ns0:br />memberinya apa-apa.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1049" begin="41482690000t" end="41497710000t" region="bottomCenter">Oh, dia tidak<ns0:br />akan bersama anda</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1050" begin="41497710000t" end="41510220000t" region="bottomCenter">jika dia tidak<ns0:br />mencintai awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1051" begin="41510220000t" end="41522730000t" region="bottomCenter">Percayalah,<ns0:br />saya tahu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1052" begin="41522730000t" end="41536500000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya akan<ns0:br />menebusnya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1053" begin="41536500000t" end="41551920000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi saya<ns0:br />fikir dia...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1054" begin="41551920000t" end="41562770000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk membawanya kembali.<ns0:br />Horus akan pergi</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1055" begin="41562770000t" end="41576950000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia cakap<ns0:br />macam tu?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1056" begin="41576950000t" end="41597810000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tahu sukar untuk<ns0:br />melihat masa lalunya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1057" begin="41597810000t" end="41611570000t" region="bottomCenter">dan pengisytiharan balas<ns0:br />dendam tetapi... pendek baran</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1058" begin="41626590000t" end="41641600000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia tidak<ns0:br />begitu teruk.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1059" begin="41647860000t" end="41659120000t" region="bottomCenter">Sukar untuk<ns0:br />dilihat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1060" begin="41752120000t" end="41765470000t" region="bottomCenter">Itu dia.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1061" begin="41774230000t" end="41789250000t" region="bottomCenter">(METALLIC RATTLE)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1062" begin="42076620000t" end="42092050000t" region="bottomCenter">BEK: Adakah<ns0:br />itu dia?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1063" begin="42099140000t" end="42119160000t" region="bottomCenter">-Sudah tentu<ns0:br />tidak. -Mereka?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1064" begin="42119160000t" end="42132500000t" region="bottomCenter">Lalu siapakah<ns0:br />mereka? (TERGAS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1065" begin="42132500000t" end="42147520000t" region="bottomCenter">hamba-hambanya<ns0:br />yang dipercayai.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1066" begin="42158370000t" end="42179220000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia hanya<ns0:br />mempercayai dirinya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1067" begin="42179220000t" end="42199660000t" region="bottomCenter">Kaya dengan kompos<ns0:br />yang banyak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1068" begin="42199660000t" end="42222590000t" region="bottomCenter">Berwarna-warni.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1069" begin="42222590000t" end="42247210000t" region="bottomCenter">Terutamanya dalam<ns0:br />spektrum hijau dan merah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1070" begin="42247210000t" end="42291000000t" region="bottomCenter">Varieti beraneka ragam dengan perbungaan<ns0:br />terdiri daripada berbilang kuntum,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1071" begin="42291000000t" end="42317280000t" region="bottomCenter">setiap satu dengan<ns0:br />kelopak yang diubah suai.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1072" begin="42317280000t" end="42352720000t" region="bottomCenter">Tuhan Firman Suci yang Bijaksana,<ns0:br />kami meminta nasihat-Mu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1073" begin="42352720000t" end="42385680000t" region="bottomCenter">tercabut dan dibakar.<ns0:br />Sekali, lalang,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1074" begin="42385680000t" end="42417790000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk kekuatan<ns0:br />minyaknya Kini dihargai</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1075" begin="42417790000t" end="42441990000t" region="bottomCenter">dan rezeki<ns0:br />daunnya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1076" begin="42441990000t" end="42468260000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi apakah<ns0:br />kebenarannya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1077" begin="42498710000t" end="42517890000t" region="bottomCenter">awak! pusing<ns0:br />balik.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1078" begin="42517890000t" end="42529990000t" region="bottomCenter">pandangan dari belakang?<ns0:br />Anda lebih suka</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1079" begin="42529990000t" end="42559600000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak, saya...<ns0:br />Ya, ya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1080" begin="42559600000t" end="42582950000t" region="bottomCenter">Awak tahu saya tidak<ns0:br />boleh berbohong. pusing.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1081" begin="42582950000t" end="42599230000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak akan<ns0:br />mengambil risiko</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1082" begin="42599230000t" end="42619660000t" region="bottomCenter">memandang matamu<ns0:br />yang licik itu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1083" begin="42619660000t" end="42643850000t" region="bottomCenter">-Empat puluh tujuh.<ns0:br />-Maafkan saya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1084" begin="42643850000t" end="42657200000t" region="bottomCenter">Peratusan ilmu yang<ns0:br />saya catat setakat ini.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1085" begin="42657200000t" end="42678890000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya belum<ns0:br />lagi separuh.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1086" begin="42678890000t" end="42707670000t" region="bottomCenter">-Jawapan kepada teka-teki -Thoth,<ns0:br />saya hanya perlukan... Sphinx.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1087" begin="42707670000t" end="42728940000t" region="bottomCenter">Seorang kanak-kanak boleh menyimpulkan<ns0:br />mengapa anda berada di sini.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1088" begin="42728940000t" end="42745200000t" region="bottomCenter">Pergi tanya<ns0:br />teka-teki</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1089" begin="42745200000t" end="42765640000t" region="bottomCenter">dan sampaikan kepada<ns0:br />saya. dan kembali</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1090" begin="42765640000t" end="42779410000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya akan<ns0:br />menyelesaikannya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1091" begin="42779410000t" end="42799840000t" region="bottomCenter">Salah seorang daripada<ns0:br />kita perlu mati.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1092" begin="42799840000t" end="42821530000t" region="bottomCenter">Nah, lukis<ns0:br />banyak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1093" begin="42821530000t" end="42840300000t" region="bottomCenter">-Mari bersama<ns0:br />kami. -Ha!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1094" begin="42840300000t" end="42866160000t" region="bottomCenter">-Saya akan memberi anda satu<ns0:br />malam. -Suatu malam. Hmm...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1095" begin="42866160000t" end="42886180000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak, anda<ns0:br />tidak akan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1096" begin="42886180000t" end="42908280000t" region="bottomCenter">sebelum dia membinasakan kita<ns0:br />semua. Set mesti dihentikan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1097" begin="42908280000t" end="42933300000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda nampak<ns0:br />hikmahnya, bukan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1098" begin="42933300000t" end="42970010000t" region="bottomCenter">terlalu penting untuk<ns0:br />mengambil risiko. Ini jauh</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1099" begin="42970010000t" end="42993360000t" region="bottomCenter">nama sebenar bintang.<ns0:br />saya boleh mengaji</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1100" begin="42993360000t" end="43011310000t" region="bottomCenter">saya tahu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1101" begin="43011310000t" end="43023390000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya telah melihat dunia yang<ns0:br />dicipta daripada pasir dan air.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1102" begin="43023390000t" end="43041340000t" region="bottomCenter">Mmm-hmm.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1103" begin="43041340000t" end="43055090000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya mengandungi semua<ns0:br />kebijaksanaan di alam semesta.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1104" begin="43055090000t" end="43078040000t" region="bottomCenter">Lebih berharga daripada<ns0:br />beberapa mahkota.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1105" begin="43078040000t" end="43103470000t" region="bottomCenter">Ha! Saya<ns0:br />ada!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1106" begin="43103470000t" end="43124750000t" region="bottomCenter">Misterinya. Intipatinya.<ns0:br />Kebenarannya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1107" begin="43137260000t" end="43149780000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia adalah<ns0:br />salad!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1108" begin="43155610000t" end="43183550000t" region="bottomCenter">menjatuhkan<ns0:br />pengawalnya. ayah awak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1109" begin="43183550000t" end="43205660000t" region="bottomCenter">Itu bukan sahaja<ns0:br />sangat bodoh,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1110" begin="43205660000t" end="43234440000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk menulis segala-galanya tetapi<ns0:br />sekarang saya terpaksa saya tahu</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1111" begin="43234440000t" end="43258630000t" region="bottomCenter">kemungkinan jauh sebagai<ns0:br />pertahanan terhadap</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1112" begin="43258630000t" end="43274480000t" region="bottomCenter">bahawa perang<ns0:br />Set menemui saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1113" begin="43274480000t" end="43309520000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya minta maaf bahawa<ns0:br />mayat ibu bapa saya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1114" begin="43309520000t" end="43323690000t" region="bottomCenter">telah<ns0:br />menyusahkan anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1115" begin="43323690000t" end="43360400000t" region="bottomCenter">Permintaan maaf diterima.<ns0:br />Sekarang, keluar!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1116" begin="43360400000t" end="43382510000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi anda perlu<ns0:br />membantu kami!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1117" begin="43382510000t" end="43393760000t" region="bottomCenter">(PEDANG BERKATA)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1118" begin="43393760000t" end="43410870000t" region="bottomCenter">THOTH: Berhati-hati.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1119" begin="43410870000t" end="43432140000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya melebihi<ns0:br />jumlah anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1120" begin="43450080000t" end="43463420000t" region="bottomCenter">Whoa,<ns0:br />whoa, whoa!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1121" begin="43482610000t" end="43502630000t" region="bottomCenter">tak mengapa.<ns0:br />Saya akan buat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1122" begin="43502630000t" end="43524310000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya fikir awak<ns0:br />adalah babun sesat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1123" begin="43524310000t" end="43548510000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya beritahu awak saya yang<ns0:br />akan berhadapan dengan Sphinx.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1124" begin="43548510000t" end="43576030000t" region="bottomCenter">Peluang kegagalan<ns0:br />anda amat besar.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1125" begin="43576030000t" end="43596050000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi sebelum ia<ns0:br />membunuh saya, saya pasti.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1126" begin="43596050000t" end="43609820000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya akan memberitahu<ns0:br />bahawa saya bertanya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1127" begin="43609820000t" end="43626500000t" region="bottomCenter">Tuhan Kebijaksanaan<ns0:br />yang akan datang</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1128" begin="43626500000t" end="43644010000t" region="bottomCenter">dia akan mendapat jawapan<ns0:br />yang salah. tetapi dia takut</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1129" begin="43644010000t" end="43669880000t" region="bottomCenter">Ini adalah strategi paling<ns0:br />bijak yang boleh anda buat?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1130" begin="43669880000t" end="43684050000t" region="bottomCenter">mempermainkan<ns0:br />ego saya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1131" begin="43684050000t" end="43705330000t" region="bottomCenter">Betapa<ns0:br />sia-sianya saya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1132" begin="43738280000t" end="43752460000t" region="bottomCenter">Um... Hmm.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1133" begin="43783330000t" end="43795420000t" region="bottomCenter">Ya, baiklah...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1134" begin="43802100000t" end="43813770000t" region="bottomCenter">baiklah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1135" begin="43822530000t" end="43834200000t" region="bottomCenter">baiklah!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1136" begin="43872580000t" end="43884250000t" region="bottomCenter">jom pergi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1137" begin="43902610000t" end="43914280000t" region="bottomCenter">Selamat tinggal.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1138" begin="43934300000t" end="43948490000t" region="bottomCenter">Syabas.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1139" begin="43948490000t" end="43963090000t" region="bottomCenter">terima kasih.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1140" begin="44113240000t" end="44134500000t" region="bottomCenter">HATHOR: Anda tahu Zayanya<ns0:br />tidak boleh kembali.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1141" begin="44134500000t" end="44154520000t" region="bottomCenter">Raja tidak<ns0:br />mempunyai kuasa.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1142" begin="44154520000t" end="44174960000t" region="bottomCenter">Anubis tidak<ns0:br />mempunyai kuasa.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1143" begin="44174960000t" end="44188730000t" region="bottomCenter">Awak<ns0:br />tipu dia.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1144" begin="44204570000t" end="44230440000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia mungkin akan mati ke<ns0:br />dalam piramid Set. cuba pecah</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1145" begin="44230440000t" end="44249210000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia menawarkan<ns0:br />nyawanya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1146" begin="44249210000t" end="44265470000t" region="bottomCenter">Kerana dia fikir dia<ns0:br />boleh menyelamatkannya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1147" begin="44265470000t" end="44284650000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia percaya apa yang<ns0:br />dia mahu percaya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1148" begin="44284650000t" end="44314680000t" region="bottomCenter">dalam lebih daripada satu<ns0:br />cara. Anda telah buta</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1149" begin="44314680000t" end="44334700000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda benar-benar<ns0:br />melihat dunia wujud?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1150" begin="44334700000t" end="44353900000t" region="bottomCenter">saya tak<ns0:br />tipu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1151" begin="44353900000t" end="44365570000t" region="bottomCenter">menontonnya dari,<ns0:br />Di manakah anda</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1152" begin="44365570000t" end="44382680000t" region="bottomCenter">jika belum ada<ns0:br />yang dicipta?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1153" begin="44382680000t" end="44408530000t" region="bottomCenter">Jika saya cuba<ns0:br />menjelaskan,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1154" begin="44408530000t" end="44426880000t" region="bottomCenter">otak anda akan cair dan<ns0:br />kehabisan telinga anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1155" begin="44443570000t" end="44469010000t" region="bottomCenter">jalan balas dendam.<ns0:br />Saya tidak memilih</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1156" begin="44469010000t" end="44486520000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak memilih<ns0:br />satu pun daripada ini.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1157" begin="44486520000t" end="44504870000t" region="bottomCenter">Awak beritahu saya apa<ns0:br />jenis kuasa yang saya ada?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1158" begin="44504870000t" end="44534080000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda mempunyai kuasa<ns0:br />untuk membetulkannya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1159" begin="44534080000t" end="44554920000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk mengetahui<ns0:br />kebenaran. Dia layak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1160" begin="44554920000t" end="44589130000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya perlukan dia untuk membawa<ns0:br />kita masuk untuk mencekik api Set.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1161" begin="44589130000t" end="44612490000t" region="bottomCenter">Adakah itu yang anda mahukan? Jika<ns0:br />dia menolak, kita semua akan mati.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1162" begin="44735100000t" end="44758880000t" region="bottomCenter">Terlalu berbahaya untuk<ns0:br />menyeberangi dataran.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1163" begin="44758880000t" end="44773900000t" region="bottomCenter">Kami akan menunggu<ns0:br />kegelapan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1164" begin="44773900000t" end="44793090000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi kita<ns0:br />kesuntukan masa.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1165" begin="44793090000t" end="44809770000t" region="bottomCenter">-Saya katakan kita menyeberang sekarang.<ns0:br />-Dan saya katakan kita tunggu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1166" begin="44833540000t" end="44845210000t" region="bottomCenter">(ELUPAS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1167" begin="44918210000t" end="44955320000t" region="bottomCenter">Sepanjang masa awak berjauhan,<ns0:br />dia tak pernah lupakan awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1168" begin="44968260000t" end="44992030000t" region="bottomCenter">Hati Hathor tau.<ns0:br />Awak selalu masuk</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1169" begin="44992030000t" end="45014140000t" region="bottomCenter">Ya, tetapi dia mempunyai<ns0:br />hati yang besar.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1170" begin="45014140000t" end="45027900000t" region="bottomCenter">Bilik yang cukup untuk<ns0:br />orang ramai di sana.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1171" begin="45043340000t" end="45078370000t" region="bottomCenter">Beritahu saya, oh, Tuhan<ns0:br />Udara yang bijaksana.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1172" begin="45078370000t" end="45098390000t" region="bottomCenter">Mengapa anda fikir Set<ns0:br />membiarkan anda hidup?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1173" begin="45121750000t" end="45136340000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia melakukannya<ns0:br />kerana cinta.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1174" begin="45136340000t" end="45165530000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda akan menghukum<ns0:br />dia untuk itu?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1175" begin="45165530000t" end="45185550000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak mahu<ns0:br />bantuan dia.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1176" begin="45204750000t" end="45225180000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya hanya mahu<ns0:br />satu perkara.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1177" begin="45235600000t" end="45276480000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya rasa semua orang<ns0:br />bodoh. awak tahu,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1178" begin="45276480000t" end="45303180000t" region="bottomCenter">adalah lebih besar daripada<ns0:br />kebanyakan. Tetapi Engkau, Tuhanku,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1179" begin="45475020000t" end="45485850000t" region="bottomCenter">memikirkan tentang dia?<ns0:br />HATHOR: Adakah awak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1180" begin="45518810000t" end="45532990000t" region="bottomCenter">Sudah<ns0:br />tentu anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1181" begin="45555920000t" end="45588040000t" region="bottomCenter">sebagai Puan Barat.<ns0:br />Saya pernah dikenali</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1182" begin="45588040000t" end="45613910000t" region="bottomCenter">Kewajipan saya adalah untuk<ns0:br />membantu roh yang mati</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1183" begin="45613910000t" end="45632260000t" region="bottomCenter">ke alam Akhirat.<ns0:br />buat cara mereka</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1184" begin="45632260000t" end="45654360000t" region="bottomCenter">ke Tanah Orang Mati?<ns0:br />Anda mengembara</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1185" begin="45654360000t" end="45680220000t" region="bottomCenter">Malah kepada mereka yang telah<ns0:br />meninggal dunia. Saya adalah Dewi Cinta.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1186" begin="45694400000t" end="45724430000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya masih muda.<ns0:br />Mudah tergoda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1187" begin="45724430000t" end="45738190000t" region="bottomCenter">"Tergoda"?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1188" begin="45738190000t" end="45753210000t" region="bottomCenter">syaitan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1189" begin="45753210000t" end="45774480000t" region="bottomCenter">Ini menghalang<ns0:br />mereka.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1190" begin="45774480000t" end="45806170000t" region="bottomCenter">Gelang 42<ns0:br />Bintang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1191" begin="45806170000t" end="45836200000t" region="bottomCenter">Satu untuk setiap syaitan yang<ns0:br />dibunuh Horus untuk membebaskan saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1192" begin="45836200000t" end="45856220000t" region="bottomCenter">Masa tu aku tahu<ns0:br />aku sayang dia.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1193" begin="45856220000t" end="45882510000t" region="bottomCenter">awak berjuang untuk<ns0:br />dia. Zaya perlu tahu</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1194" begin="45882510000t" end="45895850000t" region="bottomCenter">Jadi dia tidak<ns0:br />kehilangan harapan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1195" begin="45956320000t" end="45970510000t" region="bottomCenter">(BISIK) Zaya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1196" begin="46006370000t" end="46017640000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia akan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1197" begin="46041410000t" end="46075200000t" region="bottomCenter">Bolehkah anda mendengar<ns0:br />saya? Zaya? Zaya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1198" begin="46081040000t" end="46094800000t" region="bottomCenter">Adakah ia?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1199" begin="46098550000t" end="46113150000t" region="bottomCenter">Siapakah itu?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1200" begin="46125250000t" end="46142770000t" region="bottomCenter">Siapa<ns0:br />di sana?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1201" begin="46142770000t" end="46170290000t" region="bottomCenter">Hathor, Puan Perempuan<ns0:br />Barat. ZAYA: Cikgu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1202" begin="46170290000t" end="46190730000t" region="bottomCenter">dari Tanah Kehidupan.<ns0:br />Saya bercakap dengan awak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1203" begin="46190730000t" end="46205330000t" region="bottomCenter">Kekasih awak ada<ns0:br />bersama saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1204" begin="46205330000t" end="46219920000t" region="bottomCenter">Zaya, ini<ns0:br />saya. Bek?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1205" begin="46238690000t" end="46254960000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tahu jika ada cara,<ns0:br />anda akan menemuinya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1206" begin="46270810000t" end="46287490000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi saya tidak<ns0:br />dapat melihat awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1207" begin="46287490000t" end="46300840000t" region="bottomCenter">kita boleh bersama<ns0:br />lagi. BEK: Dengar,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1208" begin="46300840000t" end="46310430000t" region="bottomCenter">awak boleh<ns0:br />balik.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1209" begin="46310430000t" end="46325450000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi bagaimana?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1210" begin="46332540000t" end="46346710000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya menolong<ns0:br />Horus.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1211" begin="46346710000t" end="46366730000t" region="bottomCenter">dia akan menolong<ns0:br />kita. Sebagai balasan,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1212" begin="46366730000t" end="46386750000t" region="bottomCenter">ZAYA: Bek yang<ns0:br />saya sayang?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1213" begin="46386750000t" end="46407610000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tahu, Zaya. Saya<ns0:br />sendiri sukar mempercayainya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1214" begin="46407610000t" end="46426380000t" region="bottomCenter">(KECAK) Bek, saya,<ns0:br />mempercayai tuhan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1215" begin="46436800000t" end="46452660000t" region="bottomCenter">Tapi saya<ns0:br />silap, Zaya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1216" begin="46452660000t" end="46472680000t" region="bottomCenter">seperti yang anda katakan dia akan<ns0:br />menjadi. Horus adalah tuhan yang adil,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1217" begin="46472680000t" end="46492700000t" region="bottomCenter">"Saya dah beritahu awak,"<ns0:br />sekarang. Anda mungkin berfikir,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1218" begin="46492700000t" end="46518140000t" region="bottomCenter">Nah, ya. Sedikit<ns0:br />sahaja. (KETAWA)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1219" begin="46533990000t" end="46551510000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk mendengar suara<ns0:br />anda. Ia sangat baik</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1220" begin="46551510000t" end="46569440000t" region="bottomCenter">baik-baik, Zaya, percayalah.<ns0:br />BEK: Semuanya berjalan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1221" begin="46569440000t" end="46589880000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk membawa awak<ns0:br />balik. Horus akan pergi</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1222" begin="46589880000t" end="46605310000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tahu dia<ns0:br />akan melakukannya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1223" begin="46617820000t" end="46632000000t" region="bottomCenter">pertahanan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1224" begin="46642010000t" end="46656200000t" region="bottomCenter">Bek, awak<ns0:br />ada ke?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1225" begin="46659950000t" end="46679550000t" region="bottomCenter">(KAKITANGAN<ns0:br />BERKEKUT) (TERGAS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1226" begin="46679550000t" end="46709580000t" region="bottomCenter">Dilarang orang mati<ns0:br />bercakap dengan orang hidup.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1227" begin="46727930000t" end="46742110000t" region="bottomCenter">Pergi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1228" begin="46971930000t" end="46988190000t" region="bottomCenter">Ada roda<ns0:br />di dalam.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1229" begin="46988190000t" end="47009460000t" region="bottomCenter">pasir berhenti bergerak.<ns0:br />Apabila anda memutarnya,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1230" begin="47009460000t" end="47027390000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk pergi melalui<ns0:br />pintu. Kami cuma perlukan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1231" begin="47027390000t" end="47046590000t" region="bottomCenter">Nasib baik awak<ns0:br />nampak rancangan tu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1232" begin="47046590000t" end="47067430000t" region="bottomCenter">HORUS: Jika anda tidak<ns0:br />tahu yang mana satu itu,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1233" begin="47067430000t" end="47079950000t" region="bottomCenter">ini benar-benar<ns0:br />mustahil.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1234" begin="47094550000t" end="47117480000t" region="bottomCenter">-Bek? -Ya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1235" begin="47117480000t" end="47137500000t" region="bottomCenter">yang mana pintu,<ns0:br />kan? Awak tahu</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1236" begin="47147510000t" end="47161700000t" region="bottomCenter">Ya, sudah<ns0:br />tentu, ia...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1237" begin="47161700000t" end="47176300000t" region="bottomCenter">yang ini.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1238" begin="47188390000t" end="47204240000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak, tidak, itu...<ns0:br />Itu yang itu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1239" begin="47213420000t" end="47225930000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak, tidak,<ns0:br />yang ini!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1240" begin="47352720000t" end="47367320000t" region="bottomCenter">Gulung tulang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1241" begin="47377740000t" end="47396520000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1242" begin="47487850000t" end="47501200000t" region="bottomCenter">(JERENG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1243" begin="47650100000t" end="47664700000t" region="bottomCenter">(JERENG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1244" begin="47684720000t" end="47699320000t" region="bottomCenter">(DEPAN BERIRAMA)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1245" begin="47781900000t" end="47795670000t" region="bottomCenter">(KECIK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1246" begin="47814440000t" end="47824450000t" region="bottomCenter">THOTH:<ns0:br />Anda rasa?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1247" begin="47824450000t" end="47842800000t" region="bottomCenter">(Tergagap) Nah...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1248" begin="47842800000t" end="47878240000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya mendapati pergantungan<ns0:br />anda pada peluang merisaukan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1249" begin="47878240000t" end="47892850000t" region="bottomCenter">Jika anda<ns0:br />terus bertahan,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1250" begin="47892850000t" end="47907860000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya mungkin perlu<ns0:br />mengkaji anda lebih lanjut.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1251" begin="47916620000t" end="47937480000t" region="bottomCenter">jalan mana ke<ns0:br />Sphinx? sekarang,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1252" begin="48259460000t" end="48288650000t" region="bottomCenter">Penceroboh di<ns0:br />Rumah Raja,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1253" begin="48288650000t" end="48316190000t" region="bottomCenter">jawab teka-teki saya<ns0:br />atau berhenti menjadi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1254" begin="48323690000t" end="48338290000t" region="bottomCenter">Teruskan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1255" begin="48343300000t" end="48357900000t" region="bottomCenter">saya tunggu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1256" begin="48362900000t" end="48376670000t" region="bottomCenter">(GROWLES)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1257" begin="48376670000t" end="48394180000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak<ns0:br />pernah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1258" begin="48408770000t" end="48428790000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya sentiasa<ns0:br />menjadi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1259" begin="48428790000t" end="48466760000t" region="bottomCenter">Tiada siapa yang pernah melihat<ns0:br />saya, dan tidak akan pernah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1260" begin="48466760000t" end="48504710000t" region="bottomCenter">Namun saya adalah keyakinan<ns0:br />semua yang hidup dan bernafas.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1261" begin="48504710000t" end="48538080000t" region="bottomCenter">Apa saya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1262" begin="48548910000t" end="48578530000t" region="bottomCenter">Pesanan.<ns0:br />Anda Pesanan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1263" begin="48621070000t" end="48636090000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak pernah<ns0:br />meragui awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1264" begin="48660690000t" end="48678220000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1265" begin="48689050000t" end="48701570000t" region="bottomCenter">tak betul.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1266" begin="48717010000t" end="48737860000t" region="bottomCenter">Cuba lagi.<ns0:br />Tolonglah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1267" begin="48758300000t" end="48776230000t" region="bottomCenter">Itu adalah jawapan yang<ns0:br />betul-betul sesuai.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1268" begin="48782900000t" end="48794160000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERAM)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1269" begin="48794160000t" end="48810430000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda adalah<ns0:br />Kesucian.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1270" begin="48839200000t" end="48851720000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus) (MEMERENG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1271" begin="48870900000t" end="48884250000t" region="bottomCenter">(TERGAS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1272" begin="48884250000t" end="48909270000t" region="bottomCenter">silap lagi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1273" begin="48909270000t" end="48929290000t" region="bottomCenter">"Apa yang tidak pernah<ns0:br />berlaku." (GAGAP)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1274" begin="48929290000t" end="48955160000t" region="bottomCenter">"Sentiasa menjadi."</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1275" begin="48955160000t" end="48973510000t" region="bottomCenter">Pada masa hadapan.<ns0:br />Tidak wujud. khayalan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1276" begin="48973510000t" end="48988110000t" region="bottomCenter">(MERENGANG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1277" begin="48999780000t" end="49015640000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus) Namun...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1278" begin="49015640000t" end="49043160000t" region="bottomCenter">THOTH: Namun ia wujud<ns0:br />dan "tidak pernah ada."</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1279" begin="49043160000t" end="49073190000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENEGANG) Thoth...<ns0:br />"Sentiasa menjadi."</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1280" begin="49073190000t" end="49097390000t" region="bottomCenter">semua yang hidup dan bernafas.<ns0:br />Namun saya adalah keyakinan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1281" begin="49097390000t" end="49109470000t" region="bottomCenter">Manusia hidup<ns0:br />dan bernafas!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1282" begin="49109470000t" end="49125330000t" region="bottomCenter">Mungkin berhenti<ns0:br />berfikir seperti tuhan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1283" begin="49125330000t" end="49135340000t" region="bottomCenter">Kemudian saya mungkin<ns0:br />juga berhenti berfikir.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1284" begin="49135340000t" end="49148270000t" region="bottomCenter">Thoth!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1285" begin="49154110000t" end="49169530000t" region="bottomCenter">Tunggu, tunggu,<ns0:br />saya ada!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1286" begin="49169530000t" end="49187480000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda adalah<ns0:br />Esok.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1287" begin="49187480000t" end="49206240000t" region="bottomCenter">Oh, mengganggu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1288" begin="49227930000t" end="49239600000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1289" begin="49294250000t" end="49308850000t" region="bottomCenter">(SPHINX MENGERENG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1290" begin="49429790000t" end="49442310000t" region="bottomCenter">HORUS:<ns0:br />Satu titis.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1291" begin="49558260000t" end="49570770000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1292" begin="49570770000t" end="49583700000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1293" begin="49583700000t" end="49597050000t" region="bottomCenter">(SUARA BERGEMA<ns0:br />DAN MErungut)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1294" begin="49614150000t" end="49628750000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERING)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1295" begin="49664620000t" end="49680040000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya patut<ns0:br />terima kasih.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1296" begin="49695060000t" end="49716340000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda menarik dia dari perpustakaannya<ns0:br />supaya saya tidak perlu melakukannya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1297" begin="49750110000t" end="49768060000t" region="bottomCenter">Bahagian akhir.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1298" begin="49768060000t" end="49783070000t" region="bottomCenter">awak pengecut.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1299" begin="49783070000t" end="49798500000t" region="bottomCenter">Buka pintu gerbang<ns0:br />ini dan lawan saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1300" begin="49798500000t" end="49809760000t" region="bottomCenter">sekali lagi?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1301" begin="49820180000t" end="49850210000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidakkah dia sudah cukup<ns0:br />melihat awak kalah?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1302" begin="49850210000t" end="49862310000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak bolehkah awak benarkan<ns0:br />saya melepaskan awak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1303" begin="49862310000t" end="49883170000t" region="bottomCenter">satu saat terakhir<ns0:br />yang memalukan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1304" begin="49883170000t" end="49897770000t" region="bottomCenter">sebelum<ns0:br />anda mati?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1305" begin="49900680000t" end="49917790000t" region="bottomCenter">Berhenti!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1306" begin="49932800000t" end="49947400000t" region="bottomCenter">Kenali ini?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1307" begin="49973260000t" end="49995780000t" region="bottomCenter">Adakah dia memberitahu anda bahawa dia boleh<ns0:br />membawa wanita anda kembali dari kematian?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1308" begin="50009550000t" end="50022470000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia tidak<ns0:br />mungkin.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1309" begin="50030390000t" end="50047500000t" region="bottomCenter">Bukan untuk<ns0:br />saya pun.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1310" begin="50047500000t" end="50060010000t" region="bottomCenter">Awak harap saya<ns0:br />percaya awak?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1311" begin="50078780000t" end="50091290000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak<ns0:br />perlu berbohong.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1312" begin="50100460000t" end="50125490000t" region="bottomCenter">Bagaimana lagi tuhan yang<ns0:br />buta dan tidak berguna</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1313" begin="50125490000t" end="50137590000t" region="bottomCenter">minta awak<ns0:br />tolong dia?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1314" begin="50156780000t" end="50170120000t" region="bottomCenter">Teruskan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1315" begin="50173040000t" end="50187220000t" region="bottomCenter">Tanya dia.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1316" begin="50206410000t" end="50227260000t" region="bottomCenter">-Tuangkan ke dalamnya.<ns0:br />-Adakah ia benar?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1317" begin="50227260000t" end="50243940000t" region="bottomCenter">Bek, tuangkan!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1318" begin="50258550000t" end="50270220000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1319" begin="50277730000t" end="50290240000t" region="bottomCenter">(SET GRUNTS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1320" begin="50390750000t" end="50415780000t" region="bottomCenter">Malu awak tidak<ns0:br />berada di sisi saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1321" begin="50415780000t" end="50447070000t" region="bottomCenter">itu tidak membiarkan kematian<ns0:br />menghalangnya. Saya mengagumi seseorang</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1322" begin="50447070000t" end="50478350000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi inilah yang diberikan<ns0:br />oleh cinta kepada anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1323" begin="50500860000t" end="50517550000t" region="bottomCenter">Agak sesuai<ns0:br />untuk anda berdua</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1324" begin="50517550000t" end="50538830000t" region="bottomCenter">mati bersama di<ns0:br />sini di rumah saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1325" begin="50538830000t" end="50555920000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya akan merindui<ns0:br />perbualan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1326" begin="50555920000t" end="50570520000t" region="bottomCenter">Dan selebihnya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1327" begin="50613900000t" end="50628080000t" region="bottomCenter">(TERGAS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1328" begin="50665200000t" end="50679800000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1329" begin="50851210000t" end="50863310000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1330" begin="50995950000t" end="51011790000t" region="bottomCenter">(HORUS mendengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1331" begin="51031390000t" end="51045580000t" region="bottomCenter">(BATUK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1332" begin="51085200000t" end="51098130000t" region="bottomCenter">(Hembus<ns0:br />nafas berat)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1333" begin="51098130000t" end="51113140000t" region="bottomCenter">Awak menolak<ns0:br />dendam saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1334" begin="51113140000t" end="51131490000t" region="bottomCenter">(TERHANGAT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1335" begin="51131490000t" end="51146510000t" region="bottomCenter">Zaya<ns0:br />fikir awak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1336" begin="51146510000t" end="51156520000t" region="bottomCenter">perkara yang paling hebat<ns0:br />dalam semua ciptaan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1337" begin="51171530000t" end="51187810000t" region="bottomCenter">Setiap hari, dia berdoa untuk<ns0:br />kamu menyelamatkan Mesir,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1338" begin="51187810000t" end="51199490000t" region="bottomCenter">tapi awak<ns0:br />tak datang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1339" begin="51199490000t" end="51221580000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya berada di dalam<ns0:br />kubur. saya tak dengar.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1340" begin="51221580000t" end="51242020000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak, anda<ns0:br />tidak mendengar.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1341" begin="51242020000t" end="51256210000t" region="bottomCenter">adakah dendam bodoh awak.<ns0:br />Semua yang anda ambil berat</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1342" begin="51276230000t" end="51294160000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya salah tentang<ns0:br />awak. Saya mula berfikir</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1343" begin="51311670000t" end="51326280000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi saya akhirnya mendapat<ns0:br />pengajaran daripada tuhan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1344" begin="51326280000t" end="51341290000t" region="bottomCenter">Kami tidak<ns0:br />penting bagi anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1345" begin="51366320000t" end="51378410000t" region="bottomCenter">Nah, sekarang<ns0:br />anda tahu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1346" begin="51556090000t" end="51569440000t" region="bottomCenter">Anubis, keluar.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1347" begin="51620740000t" end="51634080000t" region="bottomCenter">(SANGKUT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1348" begin="51642000000t" end="51662020000t" region="bottomCenter">perempuan simpanan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1349" begin="51662020000t" end="51692050000t" region="bottomCenter">seindah subuh<ns0:br />pertama. Anda masih</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1350" begin="51692050000t" end="51712070000t" region="bottomCenter">Hathor, apa<ns0:br />yang awak buat?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1351" begin="51712070000t" end="51742100000t" region="bottomCenter">Kekasih manusia ini tidak<ns0:br />membawa harta untuk timbangan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1352" begin="51742100000t" end="51761300000t" region="bottomCenter">Mungkin kita<ns0:br />boleh tolong dia.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1353" begin="51761300000t" end="51786320000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda bertanya<ns0:br />banyak, Puan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1354" begin="51786320000t" end="51822180000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia sememangnya memerlukan<ns0:br />harta yang sangat istimewa.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1355" begin="51822180000t" end="51836370000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1356" begin="51836370000t" end="51853050000t" region="bottomCenter">-Macam ini?<ns0:br />-Tidak. Tidak!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1357" begin="51853050000t" end="51881000000t" region="bottomCenter">Puan Barat?<ns0:br />untuk awak,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1358" begin="51892250000t" end="51912270000t" region="bottomCenter">ya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1359" begin="51912270000t" end="51931880000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk memberikannya<ns0:br />sendiri. Berikan dia laluan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1360" begin="51964410000t" end="51979850000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda akan melihatnya<ns0:br />buat kali terakhir.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1361" begin="51986520000t" end="52001120000t" region="bottomCenter">terima kasih.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1362" begin="52019050000t" end="52041160000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak, tidak,<ns0:br />saya melarangnya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1363" begin="52041160000t" end="52062420000t" region="bottomCenter">Kami berdua bersalah<ns0:br />kerana menipu Bek.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1364" begin="52062420000t" end="52076190000t" region="bottomCenter">Ini akan membuat<ns0:br />perubahan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1365" begin="52076190000t" end="52111650000t" region="bottomCenter">Bukan macam ni.<ns0:br />Bukan dengan awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1366" begin="52111650000t" end="52136250000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya perintahkan<ns0:br />awak lepaskan saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1367" begin="52136250000t" end="52170040000t" region="bottomCenter">Awak tak boleh perintah<ns0:br />saya. Anda tahu mengapa.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1368" begin="52199230000t" end="52215910000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya adalah<ns0:br />Dewi Cinta.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1369" begin="52241360000t" end="52270970000t" region="bottomCenter">Jika saya tidak melakukan<ns0:br />ini, saya bukan apa-apa.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1370" begin="52270970000t" end="52292240000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak boleh<ns0:br />kehilangan awak lagi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1371" begin="52427380000t" end="52441560000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1372" begin="52670960000t" end="52682630000t" region="bottomCenter">Ambillah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1373" begin="52795660000t" end="52812760000t" region="bottomCenter">Lakukan apa yang<ns0:br />perlu anda lakukan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1374" begin="53003360000t" end="53017970000t" region="bottomCenter">Dewan Dua<ns0:br />Kebenaran.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1375" begin="53034230000t" end="53053000000t" region="bottomCenter">Di mana kita<ns0:br />akan dihakimi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1376" begin="53079700000t" end="53098460000t" region="bottomCenter">KETUA HAKIM:<ns0:br />Melangkah ke hadapan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1377" begin="53239440000t" end="53256120000t" region="bottomCenter">Apa yang anda<ns0:br />tawarkan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1378" begin="53297830000t" end="53312430000t" region="bottomCenter">(KLIK SKALA)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1379" begin="53336620000t" end="53351220000t" region="bottomCenter">Langkah ke<ns0:br />hadapan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1380" begin="53393750000t" end="53433380000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya akan hidup<ns0:br />selama-lamanya!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1381" begin="53473010000t" end="53488440000t" region="bottomCenter">KETUA HAKIM: Apa<ns0:br />yang anda tawarkan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1382" begin="53540990000t" end="53553500000t" region="bottomCenter">(KLIK SKALA)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1383" begin="53586450000t" end="53613560000t" region="bottomCenter">Langkah ke<ns0:br />hadapan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1384" begin="53718250000t" end="53732850000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1385" begin="53788740000t" end="53807500000t" region="bottomCenter">Langkah ke<ns0:br />hadapan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1386" begin="53908020000t" end="53928880000t" region="bottomCenter">Apa yang anda<ns0:br />tawarkan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1387" begin="53948060000t" end="53973910000t" region="bottomCenter">Apa yang anda<ns0:br />tawarkan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1388" begin="54064420000t" end="54076940000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia akan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1389" begin="54084440000t" end="54099050000t" region="bottomCenter">(TERKECAK<ns0:br />LEMBUT) Bek.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1390" begin="54323860000t" end="54342210000t" region="bottomCenter">(SET MENGERUM)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1391" begin="54363900000t" end="54383920000t" region="bottomCenter">HAMBA: Set,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1392" begin="54383920000t" end="54416860000t" region="bottomCenter">menerima sayap<ns0:br />emas Nephthys.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1393" begin="54416860000t" end="54449400000t" region="bottomCenter">daripada mereka yang akan membahayakan.<ns0:br />Semoga mereka melindunginya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1394" begin="54538650000t" end="54552420000t" region="bottomCenter">(Berdenting)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1395" begin="54576600000t" end="54614970000t" region="bottomCenter">HAMBA: The karr of<ns0:br />Thoth, Tuhan Kebijaksanaan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1396" begin="54614970000t" end="54640420000t" region="bottomCenter">Benarkan dia<ns0:br />pengetahuan lama.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1397" begin="54659610000t" end="54671700000t" region="bottomCenter">(ELEKTRIK KERETAK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1398" begin="54699650000t" end="54723840000t" region="bottomCenter">Hati Osiris.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1399" begin="54723840000t" end="54754290000t" region="bottomCenter">Berikan dia kuasa<ns0:br />atas semua Tanah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1400" begin="54775130000t" end="54795150000t" region="bottomCenter">Mata yang melihat<ns0:br />segala-galanya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1401" begin="54795150000t" end="54831860000t" region="bottomCenter">Beri ganjaran kepadanya supaya<ns0:br />tiada musuh yang boleh menipu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1402" begin="54855210000t" end="54868560000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERAM)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1403" begin="54944480000t" end="54956570000t" region="bottomCenter">(SET GRUNTS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1404" begin="54999950000t" end="55017880000t" region="bottomCenter">Engkau kelihatan<ns0:br />mulia, Tuhan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1405" begin="55055830000t" end="55072940000t" region="bottomCenter">saya tahu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1406" begin="55273560000t" end="55285640000t" region="bottomCenter">SET: Bapa...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1407" begin="55328190000t" end="55354050000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya perhatikan menara<ns0:br />itu. Mengagumkan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1408" begin="55361560000t" end="55379910000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya membinanya<ns0:br />untuk awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1409" begin="55379910000t" end="55410770000t" region="bottomCenter">Jika ia lebih tinggi,<ns0:br />ia akan menghalang saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1410" begin="55410770000t" end="55442890000t" region="bottomCenter">Alihkan mata anda<ns0:br />dari layar anda</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1411" begin="55442890000t" end="55455390000t" region="bottomCenter">dan lihat semua<ns0:br />yang saya lakukan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1412" begin="55475830000t" end="55494190000t" region="bottomCenter">Apa yang Osiris<ns0:br />tidak pernah dapat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1413" begin="55494190000t" end="55510460000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya memerintah<ns0:br />semua yang bernafas.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1414" begin="55522970000t" end="55538400000t" region="bottomCenter">Dan semua yang<ns0:br />dihembuskan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1415" begin="55553000000t" end="55576350000t" region="bottomCenter">Tiada yang lebih kuat<ns0:br />di bawah matahari.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1416" begin="55576350000t" end="55612230000t" region="bottomCenter">kerana saya telah menghormati<ns0:br />anda. Kemudian muliakan saya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1417" begin="55612230000t" end="55626820000t" region="bottomCenter">Jika kehormatan<ns0:br />adalah niatmu,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1418" begin="55626820000t" end="55656850000t" region="bottomCenter">daripada membunuh saudaramu.<ns0:br />anda mungkin telah berpantang</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1419" begin="55656850000t" end="55687710000t" region="bottomCenter">segalanya di bawah<ns0:br />sana. Jadi anda nampak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1420" begin="55687710000t" end="55721080000t" region="bottomCenter">adakah anda peduli apa yang<ns0:br />berlaku? Beritahu saya, Bapa,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1421" begin="55742360000t" end="55774890000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya mengambil berat lebih<ns0:br />daripada yang anda tahu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1422" begin="55774890000t" end="55792820000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya membuang seorang<ns0:br />diri Kemudian mengapa</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1423" begin="55809920000t" end="55830360000t" region="bottomCenter">berjalan di atas pasir<ns0:br />yang terbakar (BERBISIK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1424" begin="55844130000t" end="55874570000t" region="bottomCenter">manakala abang saya<ns0:br />bermain berkaki ayam</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1425" begin="55874570000t" end="55889170000t" region="bottomCenter">di tepi<ns0:br />sungai Nil?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1426" begin="55916270000t" end="55938380000t" region="bottomCenter">Kenapa awak jadikan<ns0:br />Osiris King?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1427" begin="55938380000t" end="55973000000t" region="bottomCenter">Dan mengapa kamu memberinya<ns0:br />seorang anak lelaki?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1428" begin="55973000000t" end="56000950000t" region="bottomCenter">peluang untuk memberi kehidupan.<ns0:br />Namun anda menafikan saya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1429" begin="56000950000t" end="56023050000t" region="bottomCenter">Ini adalah<ns0:br />ujian anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1430" begin="56023050000t" end="56036810000t" region="bottomCenter">Awak tak<ns0:br />uji dia.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1431" begin="56036810000t" end="56057670000t" region="bottomCenter">mahkota Mesir.<ns0:br />Saya memberi Osiris</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1432" begin="56072270000t" end="56116470000t" region="bottomCenter">dia tidak berpegang pada kuasanya.<ns0:br />Dan apabila tiba masanya,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1433" begin="56116470000t" end="56160270000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia memberikannya secara<ns0:br />percuma. Dia lulus ujiannya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1434" begin="56160270000t" end="56176950000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya telah melepasi saya.<ns0:br />Dan saya akan bertaruh</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1435" begin="56176950000t" end="56194060000t" region="bottomCenter">belum lagi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1436" begin="56199480000t" end="56219080000t" region="bottomCenter">memang betul...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1437" begin="56219080000t" end="56237850000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak mahu<ns0:br />anda mempunyai anak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1438" begin="56246600000t" end="56266620000t" region="bottomCenter">Ini adalah<ns0:br />kebaikan,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1439" begin="56266620000t" end="56285820000t" region="bottomCenter">kerana saya tidak mahu<ns0:br />awak merindui mereka</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1440" begin="56285820000t" end="56299580000t" region="bottomCenter">seteruk yang<ns0:br />saya ada.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1441" begin="56299580000t" end="56313760000t" region="bottomCenter">Rindu mereka?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1442" begin="56326680000t" end="56342120000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk mengambil tempat<ns0:br />saya. saya perlukan awak</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1443" begin="56366720000t" end="56379660000t" region="bottomCenter">Di sini?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1444" begin="56379660000t" end="56406760000t" region="bottomCenter">ujian berakhir, anakku.<ns0:br />Beginilah cara anda</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1445" begin="56406760000t" end="56426360000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak ada beban<ns0:br />yang lebih besar.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1446" begin="56451400000t" end="56464330000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi tiada penghormatan<ns0:br />yang lebih besar.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1447" begin="56496850000t" end="56525640000t" region="bottomCenter">Semua yang telah anda<ns0:br />lakukan boleh dimaafkan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1448" begin="56586940000t" end="56632410000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda mengharapkan saya untuk<ns0:br />bertanding dengan binatang ini</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1449" begin="56645760000t" end="56685380000t" region="bottomCenter">malam demi malam<ns0:br />sehingga saya mati?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1450" begin="56685380000t" end="56701230000t" region="bottomCenter">apa yang<ns0:br />awak nak?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1451" begin="56707060000t" end="56725010000t" region="bottomCenter">Keabadian.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1452" begin="56725010000t" end="56757110000t" region="bottomCenter">Keabadian menanti kita<ns0:br />semua di Akhirat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1453" begin="56757110000t" end="56789230000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak mahu mati.<ns0:br />Saya mahu hidup.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1454" begin="56789230000t" end="56805090000t" region="bottomCenter">Selamanya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1455" begin="56805090000t" end="56827180000t" region="bottomCenter">di negeri yang aku<ns0:br />takluki. Di bawah sana</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1456" begin="56827180000t" end="56837190000t" region="bottomCenter">kerajaan saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1457" begin="56837190000t" end="56860970000t" region="bottomCenter">Ini sepatutnya<ns0:br />menjadi ganjaran saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1458" begin="56860970000t" end="56896010000t" region="bottomCenter">Bagaimana? Satu-satunya cara untuk<ns0:br />mencapai ini tidak dapat difikirkan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1459" begin="56896010000t" end="56912270000t" region="bottomCenter">Seseorang perlu<ns0:br />memakan...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1460" begin="56912270000t" end="56931040000t" region="bottomCenter">Akhirat itu<ns0:br />sendiri.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1461" begin="56931040000t" end="56956490000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda akan melepaskan<ns0:br />Huru-hara semasa penciptaan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1462" begin="56956490000t" end="56977330000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda akan memusnahkan<ns0:br />segala-galanya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1463" begin="56977330000t" end="57006540000t" region="bottomCenter">Bukan memusnahkan.<ns0:br />Bentuk semula.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1464" begin="57006540000t" end="57030310000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya akan ambil<ns0:br />tempat awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1465" begin="57030310000t" end="57050740000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi ia tidak akan<ns0:br />duduk di atas bot sialan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1466" begin="57227580000t" end="57242600000t" region="bottomCenter">(SET PERNAFASAN<ns0:br />BERAT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1467" begin="57296830000t" end="57311840000t" region="bottomCenter">tahan itu. Tiada<ns0:br />tuhan boleh</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1468" begin="57327680000t" end="57348120000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya bukan hanya<ns0:br />satu tuhan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1469" begin="57360640000t" end="57374820000t" region="bottomCenter">(TERGAS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1470" begin="57715160000t" end="57742270000t" region="bottomCenter">KETUA HAKIM: Apa<ns0:br />yang anda tawarkan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1471" begin="57742270000t" end="57764790000t" region="bottomCenter">tempat di Akhirat.<ns0:br />Ini akan membeli anda</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1472" begin="57764790000t" end="57777710000t" region="bottomCenter">ZAYA: Tidak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1473" begin="57787320000t" end="57799410000t" region="bottomCenter">Bukan<ns0:br />tanpa awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1474" begin="57826520000t" end="57838190000t" region="bottomCenter">(GEMPAR)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1475" begin="57884910000t" end="57903260000t" region="bottomCenter">(JIWA MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1476" begin="57903260000t" end="57927460000t" region="bottomCenter">Pintu pagar<ns0:br />telah rosak!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1477" begin="57927460000t" end="57948300000t" region="bottomCenter">Kekacauan merebak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1478" begin="57948300000t" end="57962490000t" region="bottomCenter">musnahkan tanah ini.<ns0:br />Apophis hendaklah</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1479" begin="58014210000t" end="58027960000t" region="bottomCenter">(APOPHIS MENGERENG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1480" begin="58076360000t" end="58098450000t" region="bottomCenter">hanya harapan sekarang.<ns0:br />Horus adalah kami</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1481" begin="58098450000t" end="58111390000t" region="bottomCenter">anda fikir dia,<ns0:br />Zaya. Dia bukan tuhan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1482" begin="58111390000t" end="58127240000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia tipu<ns0:br />saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1483" begin="58127240000t" end="58145170000t" region="bottomCenter">Beri dia<ns0:br />peluang lagi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1484" begin="58145170000t" end="58165610000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia hanya sampai<ns0:br />sejauh ini kerana awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1485" begin="58165610000t" end="58184380000t" region="bottomCenter">Kekuatan saya<ns0:br />tidak terhingga.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1486" begin="58184380000t" end="58216910000t" region="bottomCenter">mempunyai apa-apa rancangan untuk membetulkan<ns0:br />perkara ini, If the Lord of the Air</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1487" begin="58216910000t" end="58238590000t" region="bottomCenter">dia harus berbuat demikian<ns0:br />dengan tergesa-gesa.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1488" begin="58238590000t" end="58267800000t" region="bottomCenter">Kalau awak tak percaya<ns0:br />dia, percayalah saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1489" begin="58267800000t" end="58279890000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tahu kita<ns0:br />akan bersama lagi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1490" begin="58400420000t" end="58415030000t" region="bottomCenter">HORUS: Ra<ns0:br />telah jatuh.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1491" begin="58415030000t" end="58433380000t" region="bottomCenter">Set telah<ns0:br />melancarkan Chaos.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1492" begin="58433380000t" end="58448380000t" region="bottomCenter">Jadi bagaimana<ns0:br />kita menghalangnya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1493" begin="58469240000t" end="58488840000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda tidak pernah<ns0:br />berputus asa, bukan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1494" begin="58488840000t" end="58504280000t" region="bottomCenter">Zaya suruh aku<ns0:br />jangan. Hanya kerana</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1495" begin="58509280000t" end="58525550000t" region="bottomCenter">tentang tawaran kami?<ns0:br />Awak tak beritahu dia</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1496" begin="58525550000t" end="58539310000t" region="bottomCenter">Ya, saya<ns0:br />memberitahunya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1497" begin="58539310000t" end="58555580000t" region="bottomCenter">dia masih percaya pada awak.<ns0:br />Tetapi atas sebab tertentu,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1498" begin="58576020000t" end="58588520000t" region="bottomCenter">Kita mesti kembali<ns0:br />ke ibu kota.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1499" begin="58598950000t" end="58613970000t" region="bottomCenter">Kemudian kita perlu berjalan<ns0:br />jauh di hadapan kita.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1500" begin="58625650000t" end="58641920000t" region="bottomCenter">(BURUNG BERKICANG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1501" begin="58641920000t" end="58656520000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya lebih<ns0:br />suka terbang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1502" begin="58693220000t" end="58704480000t" region="bottomCenter">Nephthys.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1503" begin="58709060000t" end="58731170000t" region="bottomCenter">dia cuba membantu kita.<ns0:br />Walaupun selepas kematian,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1504" begin="58785400000t" end="58796660000t" region="bottomCenter">(GEMPAR)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1505" begin="58903850000t" end="58918850000t" region="bottomCenter">Datang, syaitan!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1506" begin="59008120000t" end="59020210000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERAM)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1507" begin="59189540000t" end="59211230000t" region="bottomCenter">HORUS: Set mempunyai<ns0:br />lembing Ra.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1508" begin="59211230000t" end="59227510000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia menarik Apophis<ns0:br />ke Sungai Nil,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1509" begin="59227510000t" end="59235430000t" region="bottomCenter">kepada sumber<ns0:br />segala kehidupan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1510" begin="59235430000t" end="59253360000t" region="bottomCenter">kenapa?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1511" begin="59253360000t" end="59289640000t" region="bottomCenter">Untuk memusnahkan semua<ns0:br />ciptaan. Untuk meminumnya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1512" begin="59289640000t" end="59309660000t" region="bottomCenter">Ra belum mati. Dan hanya dia<ns0:br />yang boleh membuat ini betul.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1513" begin="59309660000t" end="59329680000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi dia memerlukan<ns0:br />lembingnya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1514" begin="59329680000t" end="59342200000t" region="bottomCenter">Jadi bagaimana kita<ns0:br />mendapatkannya kembali?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1515" begin="59351370000t" end="59369300000t" region="bottomCenter">Mungkin sudah tiba masanya<ns0:br />kita pergi memancing.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1516" begin="59438130000t" end="59459810000t" region="bottomCenter">(URSHU SOLAT SECARA<ns0:br />TAK SENTIASA)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1517" begin="59459810000t" end="59486930000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya datang dalam perkhidmatan<ns0:br />anda, saya meminta bantuan anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1518" begin="59486930000t" end="59499030000t" region="bottomCenter">HORUS: Pembina.<ns0:br />(TERGAS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1519" begin="59518210000t" end="59532810000t" region="bottomCenter">Kami memerlukan<ns0:br />anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1520" begin="59532810000t" end="59549480000t" region="bottomCenter">(GEMPAR)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1521" begin="59579930000t" end="59593280000t" region="bottomCenter">(ASKAR MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1522" begin="59720070000t" end="59749280000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia adalah satu-satunya<ns0:br />pencapaian seni bina terbesar</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1523" begin="59749280000t" end="59766380000t" region="bottomCenter">dan akan menjadi.<ns0:br />yang pernah ada</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1524" begin="59775970000t" end="59789720000t" region="bottomCenter">saya...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1525" begin="59800150000t" end="59840190000t" region="bottomCenter">Obelisk Lord Set<ns0:br />yang saya maksudkan,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1526" begin="59840190000t" end="59886910000t" region="bottomCenter">2,220 hasta tinggi.<ns0:br />berdiri dengan tepat</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1527" begin="59886910000t" end="59901920000t" region="bottomCenter">Dan bukan<ns0:br />sebatang batang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1528" begin="59901920000t" end="59924030000t" region="bottomCenter">Dibina daripada tujuh<ns0:br />bilion blok granit,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1529" begin="59924030000t" end="59952810000t" region="bottomCenter">lima bilion papak<ns0:br />batu kapur Tura,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1530" begin="59952810000t" end="59980330000t" region="bottomCenter">dan sembilan bilion<ns0:br />talenta emas.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1531" begin="59980330000t" end="59994940000t" region="bottomCenter">daripada berapa ramai<ns0:br />hamba? Dan nyawa</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1532" begin="60006620000t" end="60044150000t" region="bottomCenter">5,930.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1533" begin="60044150000t" end="60057920000t" region="bottomCenter">Tidak, tunggu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1534" begin="60068350000t" end="60107550000t" region="bottomCenter">Jadikan<ns0:br />itu 5,931.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1535" begin="60107550000t" end="60124650000t" region="bottomCenter">jangan! Anda memerlukan dia<ns0:br />untuk pergi ke bumbung.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1536" begin="60157600000t" end="60170100000t" region="bottomCenter">HORUS: Saya akan<ns0:br />jumpa awak di atas.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1537" begin="60230580000t" end="60247690000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1538" begin="60466660000t" end="60490420000t" region="bottomCenter">seolah-olah dia kawan awak.<ns0:br />Awak berdiri di sebelah dia</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1539" begin="60500850000t" end="60515460000t" region="bottomCenter">bagaimana rasanya.<ns0:br />Oh, saya tahu</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1540" begin="60515460000t" end="60534640000t" region="bottomCenter">Nikmat tuhan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1541" begin="60534640000t" end="60554660000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia memabukkan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1542" begin="60554660000t" end="60580930000t" region="bottomCenter">salah nak ikut. Saya<ns0:br />minta maaf anda memilih</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1543" begin="60580930000t" end="60593870000t" region="bottomCenter">Dia bertambah<ns0:br />baik.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1544" begin="60593870000t" end="60617640000t" region="bottomCenter">Wanita anda masih<ns0:br />mati, bukan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1545" begin="60617640000t" end="60651000000t" region="bottomCenter">Gadis yang begitu<ns0:br />cantik. malu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1546" begin="60651000000t" end="60661010000t" region="bottomCenter">Hmm...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1547" begin="60661010000t" end="60681450000t" region="bottomCenter">Kulit lembut yang<ns0:br />begitu indah.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1548" begin="60681450000t" end="60703980000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1549" begin="60726920000t" end="60746100000t" region="bottomCenter">Kekayaan<ns0:br />Dunia Akhirat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1550" begin="60746100000t" end="60761110000t" region="bottomCenter">(BEK BATUK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1551" begin="60761110000t" end="60779470000t" region="bottomCenter">Awak nampak? Saya<ns0:br />bersedia untuk mati.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1552" begin="60849960000t" end="60862050000t" region="bottomCenter">(KEDUA-DUA MENGERENG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1553" begin="60971320000t" end="60985930000t" region="bottomCenter">(APOPHIS MENGGEMPAR)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1554" begin="61093110000t" end="61108130000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1555" begin="61186130000t" end="61201130000t" region="bottomCenter">(METALLIC RATTLE)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1556" begin="61292480000t" end="61320430000t" region="bottomCenter">SET: Mari,<ns0:br />Apophis!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1557" begin="61410520000t" end="61423030000t" region="bottomCenter">(GEMPAR)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1558" begin="61473490000t" end="61490600000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1559" begin="61574430000t" end="61596950000t" region="bottomCenter">tinggal di bawah pasir.<ns0:br />Anda sepatutnya mempunyai</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1560" begin="61596950000t" end="61611960000t" region="bottomCenter">membunuh untuk mahkota,<ns0:br />saya boleh faham</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1561" begin="61611960000t" end="61628240000t" region="bottomCenter">tetapi ini<ns0:br />adalah kegilaan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1562" begin="61628240000t" end="61644920000t" region="bottomCenter">awak tak faham.<ns0:br />Sudah tentu</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1563" begin="61644920000t" end="61660350000t" region="bottomCenter">Bagaimana<ns0:br />anda boleh?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1564" begin="61660350000t" end="61675360000t" region="bottomCenter">daripada anak lelaki yang<ns0:br />disayangi. Anak kesayangan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1565" begin="61729170000t" end="61741670000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1566" begin="62039480000t" end="62051980000t" region="bottomCenter">(BEK MENJERONG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1567" begin="62139160000t" end="62152500000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGKEK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1568" begin="62152500000t" end="62169610000t" region="bottomCenter">By the<ns0:br />way,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1569" begin="62169610000t" end="62190470000t" region="bottomCenter">Apophis akan makan<ns0:br />Tanah Orang Mati.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1570" begin="62190470000t" end="62204640000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda tidak akan pernah<ns0:br />sampai ke Akhirat sekarang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1571" begin="62204640000t" end="62219240000t" region="bottomCenter">(TEREKUT) Apa?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1572" begin="62248860000t" end="62262190000t" region="bottomCenter">(JERENG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1573" begin="62294730000t" end="62313920000t" region="bottomCenter">Siapa yang salah<ns0:br />pilih tuhan sekarang?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1574" begin="62444880000t" end="62459070000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1575" begin="62572920000t" end="62587110000t" region="bottomCenter">(KEDUA-DUA MENDERENG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1576" begin="62630910000t" end="62663010000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya fikir saya mungkin sebenarnya<ns0:br />merindui pertemuan kecil kami.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1577" begin="62672200000t" end="62683870000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1578" begin="62713480000t" end="62735590000t" region="bottomCenter">Tetapi awak masih tiada<ns0:br />tandingan untuk saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1579" begin="62746850000t" end="62761870000t" region="bottomCenter">awak betul.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1580" begin="62777300000t" end="62792320000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya hanya<ns0:br />umpan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1581" begin="62850290000t" end="62862790000t" region="bottomCenter">Sekarang anda hanya<ns0:br />menjadi perosak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1582" begin="62876150000t" end="62890750000t" region="bottomCenter">(SET GRUNTS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1583" begin="62895750000t" end="62910350000t" region="bottomCenter">(BEK SERU)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1584" begin="62962070000t" end="62974160000t" region="bottomCenter">(TANAH BEK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1585" begin="62992520000t" end="63004190000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1586" begin="63046320000t" end="63063830000t" region="bottomCenter">Horus!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1587" begin="63283630000t" end="63294900000t" region="bottomCenter">(JERENG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1588" begin="63345360000t" end="63359970000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1589" begin="63404170000t" end="63421280000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1590" begin="63485500000t" end="63503030000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda tidak fikir<ns0:br />mata anda mungkin</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1591" begin="63503030000t" end="63516790000t" region="bottomCenter">daripada pencuri yang<ns0:br />cedera? lebih berguna</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1592" begin="63516790000t" end="63531390000t" region="bottomCenter">Mungkin, ya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1593" begin="63553900000t" end="63573500000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya minta maaf atas semua<ns0:br />yang saya lakukan pada awak.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1594" begin="63576430000t" end="63593940000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1595" begin="63593940000t" end="63606880000t" region="bottomCenter">Termasuk ini.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1596" begin="63606880000t" end="63621060000t" region="bottomCenter">Diterima.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1597" begin="63917190000t" end="63953060000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya akan curi mata awak yang<ns0:br />sebelah lagi. (KECEWA) Saya dah cakap</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1598" begin="63953060000t" end="63965150000t" region="bottomCenter">menyelamatkan saya beberapa masalah<ns0:br />Tetapi anda boleh mempunyai</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1599" begin="63965150000t" end="63978920000t" region="bottomCenter">anda tidak memerlukannya.<ns0:br />dan memberitahu saya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1600" begin="63978920000t" end="63999350000t" region="bottomCenter">Ra menunjukkan<ns0:br />saya jalan,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1601" begin="63999350000t" end="64015200000t" region="bottomCenter">tetapi saya<ns0:br />tidak mendengar.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1602" begin="64015200000t" end="64040230000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya percaya saya memerlukan<ns0:br />mata saya untuk berubah,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1603" begin="64040230000t" end="64067340000t" region="bottomCenter">tetapi perjalanan saya bukan untuk<ns0:br />membalas dendam pada semua kos.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1604" begin="64081100000t" end="64096950000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia adalah untuk<ns0:br />melindungi rakyat saya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1605" begin="64108210000t" end="64133660000t" region="bottomCenter">Berhenti mengucapkan tahniah<ns0:br />kepada diri sendiri.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1606" begin="64133660000t" end="64144490000t" region="bottomCenter">melindungi untuk<ns0:br />dilakukan. Anda ada lebih</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1607" begin="64281300000t" end="64294220000t" region="bottomCenter">(MERENGANG LEMBUT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1608" begin="64398920000t" end="64413940000t" region="bottomCenter">(ORANG BERSORAK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1609" begin="64789310000t" end="64803910000t" region="bottomCenter">(SET MERENGUS)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1610" begin="64861050000t" end="64874800000t" region="bottomCenter">(SET MENGERANG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1611" begin="64925690000t" end="64937790000t" region="bottomCenter">(MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1612" begin="64985750000t" end="65002860000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1613" begin="65095440000t" end="65105450000t" region="bottomCenter">(APOPHIS MENGGEMPAR)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1614" begin="65105450000t" end="65120470000t" region="bottomCenter">(ASKAR MENJERIT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1615" begin="65350700000t" end="65366970000t" region="bottomCenter">(MERENGANG LEMBUT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1616" begin="65495840000t" end="65511280000t" region="bottomCenter">(BATUK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1617" begin="65540480000t" end="65555480000t" region="bottomCenter">(BERNAFAS BERAT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1618" begin="65583860000t" end="65625550000t" region="bottomCenter">Lihatlah, Raja<ns0:br />yang baru.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1619" begin="65645990000t" end="65671020000t" region="bottomCenter">yang paling agung dari segala<ns0:br />tuhan. Saya fikir anda adalah</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1620" begin="65671020000t" end="65691880000t" region="bottomCenter">Sekarang tengok<ns0:br />awak. (Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1621" begin="65691880000t" end="65711900000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda tidak<ns0:br />mempunyai apa-apa.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1622" begin="65711900000t" end="65735660000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya adalah tuhan<ns0:br />yang paling hebat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1623" begin="65746090000t" end="65759440000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya selamatkan<ns0:br />awak sekali.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1624" begin="65766530000t" end="65776120000t" region="bottomCenter">Hah?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1625" begin="65776120000t" end="65797810000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya menunjukkan belas<ns0:br />kasihan kepada anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1626" begin="65797810000t" end="65814500000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak akan<ns0:br />melakukan kesilapan itu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1627" begin="65822840000t" end="65835760000t" region="bottomCenter">(Merengus)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1628" begin="65999270000t" end="66019700000t" region="bottomCenter">HORUS: Atuk,<ns0:br />masih ada masa.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1629" begin="66071420000t" end="66086010000t" region="bottomCenter">Cukuplah, binatang!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1630" begin="66146490000t" end="66161100000t" region="bottomCenter">(APOPHIS MENGERUNG)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1631" begin="66347110000t" end="66364220000t" region="bottomCenter">(Mengeluh)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1632" begin="66870140000t" end="66884320000t" region="bottomCenter">terima kasih.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1633" begin="66925200000t" end="66940620000t" region="bottomCenter">(ORANG BERSORAK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1634" begin="66947290000t" end="66960230000t" region="bottomCenter">(TEPUK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1635" begin="66985670000t" end="67004440000t" region="bottomCenter">HORUS: Kami membentuk<ns0:br />pasukan yang baik.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1636" begin="67004440000t" end="67025710000t" region="bottomCenter">awak bukan tuhan?<ns0:br />Adakah anda pasti</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1637" begin="67025710000t" end="67047390000t" region="bottomCenter">Apa yang saya akan<ns0:br />menjadi tuhan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1638" begin="67047390000t" end="67063250000t" region="bottomCenter">(Hembus<ns0:br />nafas berat)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1639" begin="67063250000t" end="67077000000t" region="bottomCenter">Kebodohan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1640" begin="67092030000t" end="67106630000t" region="bottomCenter">Yang Mustahil.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1641" begin="67150420000t" end="67164600000t" region="bottomCenter">pertahanan?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1642" begin="67701800000t" end="67720570000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak<ns0:br />pernah berhutang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1643" begin="67720570000t" end="67743090000t" region="bottomCenter">Namun saya berhutang<ns0:br />dengan awak, cucu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1644" begin="67753940000t" end="67778120000t" region="bottomCenter">Tanya apa sahaja<ns0:br />yang anda mahu.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1645" begin="67778120000t" end="67801900000t" region="bottomCenter">Gunung akan berlutut<ns0:br />di hadapan anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1646" begin="67801900000t" end="67818160000t" region="bottomCenter">akan melakukan<ns0:br />tawaran anda. Angin</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1647" begin="67818160000t" end="67843190000t" region="bottomCenter">kerana Apophis masih<ns0:br />lapar. Jawab dengan cepat,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1648" begin="67856540000t" end="67875730000t" region="bottomCenter">Dan malam<ns0:br />sentiasa datang.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1649" begin="67917440000t" end="67929530000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya tidak<ns0:br />mahu apa-apa.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1650" begin="67949960000t" end="67967890000t" region="bottomCenter">Kecuali apa yang mustahil<ns0:br />untuk saya berikan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1651" begin="68142240000t" end="68159760000t" region="bottomCenter">(Tercungap-cungap)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1652" begin="68228990000t" end="68248590000t" region="bottomCenter">adakah saya...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1653" begin="68248590000t" end="68269030000t" region="bottomCenter">(KECEWA) Anda telah<ns0:br />kembali. (KETAWA)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1654" begin="68269030000t" end="68287810000t" region="bottomCenter">HORUS: Mulut?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1655" begin="68287810000t" end="68298640000t" region="bottomCenter">nak tolong dia.<ns0:br />Anda mungkin</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1656" begin="68319500000t" end="68337440000t" region="bottomCenter">Ia akan.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1657" begin="68364970000t" end="68378300000t" region="bottomCenter">(ZAYA BERNAFAS<ns0:br />BERAT)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1658" begin="68386660000t" end="68403340000t" region="bottomCenter">(LEMBUT) Bek.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1659" begin="68403340000t" end="68417940000t" region="bottomCenter">HORUS: Zaya?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1660" begin="68425030000t" end="68437120000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya Horus.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1661" begin="68437120000t" end="68448790000t" region="bottomCenter">Tuanku.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1662" begin="68448790000t" end="68463400000t" region="bottomCenter">Saya fikir ini<ns0:br />adalah mustahil.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1663" begin="68463400000t" end="68488410000t" region="bottomCenter">Mustahil? ya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1664" begin="68568910000t" end="68579760000t" region="bottomCenter">(ORANG BERSORAK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1665" begin="68579760000t" end="68608530000t" region="bottomCenter">ORANG RAMAI: Salam<ns0:br />Ra, Tuan Cahaya!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1666" begin="68626060000t" end="68651500000t" region="bottomCenter">Salam Ra,<ns0:br />Tuhan Cahaya!</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1667" begin="68679020000t" end="68704890000t" region="bottomCenter">kebijaksanaan telah ditemui.<ns0:br />ODER BEK: Dan sebagainya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1668" begin="68704890000t" end="68739080000t" region="bottomCenter">Ujian telah dilalui.<ns0:br />Peluang kedua diberi.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1669" begin="68739080000t" end="68756190000t" region="bottomCenter">Untuk hidup<ns0:br />semula.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1670" begin="68756190000t" end="68776210000t" region="bottomCenter">Untuk<ns0:br />kembali utuh.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1671" begin="68776210000t" end="68802070000t" region="bottomCenter">Horus meratapi<ns0:br />ibu bapanya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1672" begin="68802070000t" end="68827930000t" region="bottomCenter">Mereka telah lama<ns0:br />berlalu ke Alam Akhirat.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1673" begin="68827930000t" end="68848370000t" region="bottomCenter">itu adalah kebijaksanaan<ns0:br />Ra Tetapi dia tahu</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1674" begin="68848370000t" end="68881310000t" region="bottomCenter">kekal seperti sediakala.<ns0:br />bahawa Gerbang Akhir akan</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1675" begin="68881310000t" end="68933030000t" region="bottomCenter">Penghalang yang tidak dapat dipecahkan<ns0:br />antara kehidupan ini dan keabadian.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1676" begin="68933030000t" end="68943880000t" region="bottomCenter">Awak rasa saya<ns0:br />sudah bersedia?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1677" begin="68943880000t" end="68969310000t" region="bottomCenter">Hmm, kesediaan<ns0:br />sebenar</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1678" begin="68969310000t" end="69003520000t" region="bottomCenter">adalah keadaan yang<ns0:br />terkenal sukar dicapai.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1679" begin="69003520000t" end="69028960000t" region="bottomCenter">-Tetapi awak<ns0:br />cukup dekat. -Hmm.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1680" begin="69157430000t" end="69184530000t" region="bottomCenter">Bangun, Horus...</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1681" begin="69184530000t" end="69210810000t" region="bottomCenter">Raja seluruh<ns0:br />Mesir.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1682" begin="69255860000t" end="69269200000t" region="bottomCenter">(ORANG BERSORAK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1683" begin="69305490000t" end="69330090000t" region="bottomCenter">Mulai<ns0:br />saat ini,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1684" begin="69330090000t" end="69352200000t" region="bottomCenter">Akhirat mesti diperolehi,<ns0:br />bukan dengan emas,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1685" begin="69368890000t" end="69397250000t" region="bottomCenter">tetapi dengan perbuatan<ns0:br />baik, belas kasihan,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1686" begin="69407680000t" end="69420600000t" region="bottomCenter">dan kemurahan<ns0:br />hati.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1687" begin="69429770000t" end="69468570000t" region="bottomCenter">Apa yang kita lakukan, bagaimana kita<ns0:br />bertindak dalam kehidupan ini penting.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1688" begin="69482750000t" end="69499430000t" region="bottomCenter">(ORANG BERSORAK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1689" begin="69543640000t" end="69558240000t" region="bottomCenter">Adakah anda berfikir<ns0:br />tentang dia?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1690" begin="69579920000t" end="69594940000t" region="bottomCenter">Sudah<ns0:br />tentu, anda.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1691" begin="69635820000t" end="69653330000t" region="bottomCenter">Anda tidak fikir saya akan<ns0:br />melesetkan khazanah terbesar Mesir?</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1692" begin="69670430000t" end="69697970000t" region="bottomCenter">jika saya pergi beberapa hari? Anda<ns0:br />fikir mereka akan merindui saya</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1693" begin="69697970000t" end="69720060000t" region="bottomCenter">Sebagai Ketua<ns0:br />Penasihat Raja,</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1694" begin="69720060000t" end="69740080000t" region="bottomCenter">menjadi kewajipan saya untuk<ns0:br />memastikan mereka tidak menyedarinya.</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1695" begin="69740080000t" end="69760100000t" region="bottomCenter">BEK: Tapi kalau ada<ns0:br />yang tanya.. (TERKECAK)</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1696" begin="69760100000t" end="69776790000t" region="bottomCenter">untuk pergi membantu rakan.<ns0:br />Beritahu mereka saya ada</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1697" begin="69800140000t" end="69827680000t" region="bottomCenter">di tangan anda yang mampu.<ns0:br />Saya meninggalkan Mesir</ns0:p><ns0:p xml:id="p1698" begin="69839360000t" end="69849780000t" region="bottomCenter">(KECIK)</ns0:p></ns0:div>
</ns0:body>
</ns0:tt>